connect-and-extend/packages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/packages#-what-comes-with-home","content":"**Learning and play**: tutor, trivia, jokes, bedtime storybook, music"},"57":{"id":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/packages-11","page_id":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/packages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/packages#-what-comes-with-home","content":"**Home control**: lights on and off, lock doors"},"58":{"id":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/packages-12","page_id":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/packages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/packages#-what-comes-with-home","content":"**Memory**: remember and recall"},"59":{"id":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/packages-13","page_id":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/packages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/packages#-what-comes-with-home","content":"**News feeds**: household feeds and kids' feeds"},"60":{"id":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/packages-14","page_id":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/packages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/packages#-what-comes-with-home","content":"A shelf of apps on the Home screen is planned, not available yet."},"61":{"id":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/packages-15","page_id":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/packages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/packages#-who-can-use-a-package","content":"Each package declares the lowest role that may use it. A child sees only what a child may use. Kids' news feeds, for example, are for children."},"62":{"id":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/packages-16","page_id":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/packages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/packages#-who-can-use-a-package","content":"The child's **Limits** tab saves daily minutes for each kind of package. Enforcing them in the package host is planned, not available yet. See Add people and parental controls."},"63":{"id":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/packages-17","page_id":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/packages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/packages#-what-a-package-may-do","content":"Every package lists the outside services it contacts, when and why. Those rows feed the privacy audit. A package that contacts nothing adds no row."},"64":{"id":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/packages-18","page_id":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/packages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/packages#-install-update-and-remove","content":"Planned, not in the app yet: browsing the MaiPai catalog and installing packages from a screen. Home has no store page today."},"65":{"id":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/packages-19","page_id":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/packages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/packages#-install-update-and-remove","content":"The Home server already has the groundwork:"},"66":{"id":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/packages-20","page_id":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/packages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/packages#-install-update-and-remove","content":"A signed catalog index check, so a tampered catalog is rejected."},"67":{"id":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/packages-21","page_id":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/packages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/packages#-install-update-and-remove","content":"Install, roll back, uninstall and switch between **stable** and **beta** per package."},"68":{"id":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/packages-22","page_id":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/packages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/packages#-install-update-and-remove","content":"Only an owner or admin may do any of them."},"69":{"id":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/packages-23","page_id":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/packages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/packages#-install-update-and-remove","content":"These are available to developers through the Home API, not through a button. See Developers."},"70":{"id":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/packages-24","page_id":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/packages","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/packages#-if-a-package-misbehaves","content":"Open **Repairs** and check for an item. Then see Troubleshooting."},"71":{"id":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/remote-access","page_id":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/remote-access","type":"page","content":"Reach Home when you are away","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Admin guide","🔌 Connect and extend"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/remote-access"},"72":{"id":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/remote-access-0","page_id":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/remote-access","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/remote-access","content":"Use Tailscale to open Home from a phone outside the house, with a private https address."},"73":{"id":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/remote-access-1","page_id":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/remote-access","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/remote-access#-before-you-start","content":"✅ Before you start"},"74":{"id":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/remote-access-2","page_id":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/remote-access","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/remote-access#️-turn-it-on","content":"✍️ Turn it on"},"75":{"id":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/remote-access-3","page_id":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/remote-access","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/remote-access#-add-a-phone-or-tablet","content":"📱 Add a phone or tablet"},"76":{"id":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/remote-access-4","page_id":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/remote-access","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/remote-access#-related-settings","content":"🔧 Related settings"},"77":{"id":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/remote-access-5","page_id":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/remote-access","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/remote-access#-privacy","content":"🔐 Privacy"},"78":{"id":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/remote-access-6","page_id":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/remote-access","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/remote-access","content":"By default Home works only on your home Wi-Fi. To use it from anywhere, Home uses **Tailscale**, a free app that links your family's devices privately. Conversations go straight between the device and your Home computer. Tailscale sees device names and addresses, not what you say."},"79":{"id":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/remote-access-7","page_id":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/remote-access","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/remote-access","content":"Home never turns this on by itself. Only an owner or admin can."},"80":{"id":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/remote-access-8","page_id":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/remote-access","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/remote-access#-before-you-start","content":"Install Tailscale on the Home computer from tailscale.com/download."},"81":{"id":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/remote-access-9","page_id":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/remote-access","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/remote-access#-before-you-start","content":"Sign in to Tailscale with the account your family's devices will use."},"82":{"id":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/remote-access-10","page_id":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/remote-access","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/remote-access#-before-you-start","content":"Open Tailscale's DNS settings and turn on HTTPS certificates."},"83":{"id":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/remote-access-11","page_id":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/remote-access","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/remote-access#-before-you-start","content":"Pick a plain computer name first. Turning this on publishes the computer's Tailscale name in public certificate logs, so do not use a family name. Headscale is not supported by this flow."},"84":{"id":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/remote-access-12","page_id":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/remote-access","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/remote-access#️-turn-it-on","content":"Open **Settings**, then **Home settings**, then **Network and access**."},"85":{"id":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/remote-access-13","page_id":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/remote-access","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/remote-access#️-turn-it-on","content":"Under **Reach Home from anywhere**, wait until the three lines say Ready."},"86":{"id":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/remote-access-14","page_id":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/remote-access","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/remote-access#️-turn-it-on","content":"Press **Turn on**."},"87":{"id":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/remote-access-15","page_id":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/remote-access","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/remote-access#️-turn-it-on","content":"Home shows a secure address and a QR code."},"88":{"id":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/remote-access-16","page_id":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/remote-access","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/remote-access#️-turn-it-on","content":"If a line is not ready, the **Turn on** button stays grey. If Tailscale is not signed in or HTTPS certificates are off, Home says \"Sign in to Tailscale and enable HTTPS certificates first.\" Fix that in Tailscale, return to Home and try again."},"89":{"id":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/remote-access-17","page_id":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/remote-access","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/remote-access#-add-a-phone-or-tablet","content":"Install Tailscale on the device."},"90":{"id":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/remote-access-18","page_id":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/remote-access","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/remote-access#-add-a-phone-or-tablet","content":"Sign in with the same account."},"91":{"id":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/remote-access-19","page_id":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/remote-access","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/remote-access#-add-a-phone-or-tablet","content":"Scan the QR code, or open the address."},"92":{"id":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/remote-access-20","page_id":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/remote-access","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/remote-access#-add-a-phone-or-tablet","content":"The address works only on devices signed in to your Tailscale account."},"93":{"id":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/remote-access-21","page_id":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/remote-access","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/remote-access#-related-settings","content":"| Setting                           | Default | Meaning                    |\n| --------------------------------- | ------- | -------------------------- |\n| **Away access through Tailscale** | Off     | Set when you turn this on. |","table":"table-0"},"94":{"id":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/remote-access-22","page_id":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/remote-access","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/remote-access#-related-settings","content":"| Setting                | Default | Meaning                                                                                               |\n| ---------------------- | ------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Who can reach Home** | LAN     | Loopback keeps Home on this computer. LAN lets devices on your home network connect. Needs a restart. |","table":"table-0"},"95":{"id":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/remote-access-23","page_id":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/remote-access","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/remote-access#-related-settings","content":"| Setting               | Default | Meaning                                                                |\n| --------------------- | ------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Home network port** | 3000    | The port Home listens on. Changing it changes the address devices use. |","table":"table-0"},"96":{"id":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/remote-access-24","page_id":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/remote-access","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/remote-access#-related-settings","content":"| Setting                                           | Default | Meaning                                                              |\n| ------------------------------------------------- | ------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Reach the engine computer when away from home** | Off     | For a separate engine computer. See Use another computer for the AI. |","table":"table-0"},"97":{"id":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/remote-access-25","page_id":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/remote-access","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/remote-access#-privacy","content":"Tailscale and the certificate authority are the two outside services involved. Both appear on the privacy page, and only after you opt in."},"98":{"id":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/remote-access-26","page_id":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/remote-access","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/remote-access#-privacy","content":"Planned, not in the app yet: turning remote access on from the setup wizard. The wizard shows \"Set up later\", and you finish here."},"99":{"id":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/web-search","page_id":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/web-search","type":"page","content":"Set up web search","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Admin guide","🔌 Connect and extend"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/web-search"},"100":{"id":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/web-search-0","page_id":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/web-search","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/web-search","content":"Choose where answers come from, connect SearXNG, and keep children and teens safe."},"101":{"id":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/web-search-1","page_id":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/web-search","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/web-search#-library-or-internet","content":"📚 Library or internet"},"102":{"id":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/web-search-2","page_id":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/web-search","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/web-search#-connect-searxng","content":"🔍 Connect SearXNG"},"103":{"id":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/web-search-3","page_id":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/web-search","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/web-search#-other-sources","content":"🦆 Other sources"},"104":{"id":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/web-search-4","page_id":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/web-search","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/web-search#️-safe-search","content":"🛡️ Safe search"},"105":{"id":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/web-search-5","page_id":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/web-search","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/web-search","content":"Home answers most questions from the model and its offline reference library. When a question needs fresh facts, Home can search the web. Web search is off until you set it up."},"106":{"id":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/web-search-6","page_id":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/web-search","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/web-search#-library-or-internet","content":"Under **Settings**, **Home settings**, **Search**, pick **Search sources**:"},"107":{"id":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/web-search-7","page_id":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/web-search","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/web-search#-library-or-internet","content":"| Choice                      | What Home does                                                    |\n| --------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Library first** (default) | Checks the offline library, goes online only if it has no answer. |","table":"table-0"},"108":{"id":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/web-search-8","page_id":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/web-search","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/web-search#-library-or-internet","content":"| Choice             | What Home does                                 |\n| ------------------ | ---------------------------------------------- |\n| **Internet first** | Goes online even when the library has a match. |","table":"table-0"},"109":{"id":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/web-search-9","page_id":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/web-search","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/web-search#-library-or-internet","content":"| Choice           | What Home does                                                                                        |\n| ---------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Library only** | Turns off the live Wikipedia-style lookup. Web search stays on unless it is also set to Library only. |","table":"table-0"},"110":{"id":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/web-search-10","page_id":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/web-search","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/web-search#-library-or-internet","content":"**Encyclopedia lookups** and **Web searches** (advanced) can each follow the household choice or override it. Children and teens keep their protections in every mode."},"111":{"id":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/web-search-11","page_id":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/web-search","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/web-search#-connect-searxng","content":"SearXNG is a search service you run yourself. Home asks it for results, so no search company sees who asked."},"112":{"id":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/web-search-12","page_id":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/web-search","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/web-search#-connect-searxng","content":"Run SearXNG on a computer in your home. Turn on its JSON output."},"113":{"id":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/web-search-13","page_id":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/web-search","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/web-search#-connect-searxng","content":"Open **Settings**, **Home settings**, **Search**."},"114":{"id":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/web-search-14","page_id":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/web-search","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/web-search#-connect-searxng","content":"Type its address in **Your own SearXNG (optional)**, for example `http://192.0.2.20:8080`."},"115":{"id":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/web-search-15","page_id":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/web-search","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/web-search#-connect-searxng","content":"Ask Home something recent in **Chat**. A sources list appears under the reply."},"116":{"id":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/web-search-16","page_id":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/web-search","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/web-search#-connect-searxng","content":"Until an address is set, Home says \"Web search isn't set up yet\". Library and Wikipedia lookups still work."},"117":{"id":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/web-search-17","page_id":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/web-search","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/web-search#-connect-searxng","content":"Home checks SearXNG every hour while it is healthy and every 15 minutes while it is not. A failing check appears under **Repairs**, with the step to take. Check the computer is on, the address is right and JSON output is enabled."},"118":{"id":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/web-search-18","page_id":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/web-search","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/web-search#-other-sources","content":"| Source         | Who gets it | How to enable                                                                                                                      |\n| -------------- | ----------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **DuckDuckGo** | Adults only | Start the ddgs helper on the same computer, set `MAIPAI_DDGS_URL` to its loopback address, then pick it in **Web search sources**. |","table":"table-1"},"119":{"id":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/web-search-19","page_id":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/web-search","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/web-search#-other-sources","content":"| Source           | Who gets it | How to enable                                                                                                         |\n| ---------------- | ----------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Brave Search** | Adults only | Paste a key in **Brave Search key (optional)**. The words an adult searches go to Brave. The key is stored encrypted. |","table":"table-1"},"120":{"id":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/web-search-20","page_id":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/web-search","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/web-search#-other-sources","content":"Without the helper, Home says \"DuckDuckGo search is not set up. Start the ddgs sidecar and set MAIPAI_DDGS_URL, or pick another web search source.\" A child's or teen's search never goes to either."},"121":{"id":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/web-search-21","page_id":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/web-search","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/web-search#️-safe-search","content":"| Setting               | Behavior                                                                                                        |\n| --------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Safe search level** | **Default** follows age: strict for a child, moderate for a teen, off for an adult. A child's is always strict. |","table":"table-2"},"122":{"id":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/web-search-22","page_id":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/web-search","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/web-search#️-safe-search","content":"| Setting                            | Behavior                                                                                |\n| ---------------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Web search with child controls** | On: strictest SafeSearch, adult sites blocked, links hidden. Off: offline library only. |","table":"table-2"},"123":{"id":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/web-search-23","page_id":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/web-search","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/web-search#️-safe-search","content":"| Setting                           | Behavior                  |\n| --------------------------------- | ------------------------- |\n| **Web search with teen controls** | On: moderate or stricter. |","table":"table-2"},"124":{"id":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/web-search-24","page_id":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/web-search","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/web-search#️-safe-search","content":"| Setting             | Behavior                                                                           |\n| ------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Page text check** | Cleans fetched page text before the assistant reads it. On for children and teens. |","table":"table-2"},"125":{"id":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/web-search-25","page_id":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/web-search","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/connect-and-extend/web-search#️-safe-search","content":"For site lists, see Blocked-site lists. For exactly what leaves the house, see Privacy audit. To use search from a phone away from home, see Remote access."},"126":{"id":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/how-home-works","page_id":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/how-home-works","type":"page","content":"How MaiPai Home works","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Admin guide","🧩 How it works"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/how-home-works"},"127":{"id":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/how-home-works-0","page_id":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/how-home-works","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/how-home-works","content":"The parts of a MaiPai Home, what each one does, and where it runs."},"128":{"id":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/how-home-works-1","page_id":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/how-home-works","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/how-home-works#️-the-parts","content":"🗺️ The parts"},"129":{"id":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/how-home-works-2","page_id":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/how-home-works","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/how-home-works#-what-happens-when-someone-asks-a-question","content":"🔁 What happens when someone asks a question"},"130":{"id":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/how-home-works-3","page_id":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/how-home-works","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/how-home-works#-what-this-means-for-you","content":"🏠 What this means for you"},"131":{"id":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/how-home-works-4","page_id":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/how-home-works","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/how-home-works#-where-things-are-in-the-app","content":"🧭 Where things are in the app"},"132":{"id":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/how-home-works-5","page_id":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/how-home-works","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/how-home-works","content":"MaiPai Home is one program that runs on a computer in your house. People reach it from a browser on a phone, tablet or laptop on your home Wi-Fi. Nothing goes through a MaiPai server, because there is none."},"133":{"id":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/how-home-works-6","page_id":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/how-home-works","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/how-home-works#️-the-parts","content":"| Part               | What it does                                                                            | Where it runs                     |\n| ------------------ | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | --------------------------------- |\n| **Home (the hub)** | Holds people, memories, conversations, settings, backups and the screens everyone uses. | The computer you installed it on. |","table":"table-0"},"134":{"id":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/how-home-works-7","page_id":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/how-home-works","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/how-home-works#️-the-parts","content":"| Part                   | What it does                                                   | Where it runs                                                            |\n| ---------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| **Stack (the engine)** | Runs the AI models for chat, listening, speaking and pictures. | The same computer, or a second one. See Use another computer for the AI. |","table":"table-0"},"135":{"id":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/how-home-works-8","page_id":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/how-home-works","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/how-home-works#️-the-parts","content":"| Part         | What it does                                                               | Where it runs |\n| ------------ | -------------------------------------------------------------------------- | ------------- |\n| **Packages** | Small features such as weather, timers and news. Home ships a default set. | Inside Home.  |","table":"table-0"},"136":{"id":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/how-home-works-9","page_id":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/how-home-works","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/how-home-works#️-the-parts","content":"| Part      | What it does                                     | Where it runs     |\n| --------- | ------------------------------------------------ | ----------------- |\n| **Robot** | An optional companion body that pairs with Home. | Its own hardware. |","table":"table-0"},"137":{"id":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/how-home-works-10","page_id":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/how-home-works","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/how-home-works#-what-happens-when-someone-asks-a-question","content":"The person types or speaks in the browser."},"138":{"id":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/how-home-works-11","page_id":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/how-home-works","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/how-home-works#-what-happens-when-someone-asks-a-question","content":"Home checks who they are and what their role allows."},"139":{"id":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/how-home-works-12","page_id":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/how-home-works","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/how-home-works#-what-happens-when-someone-asks-a-question","content":"Home builds the request and sends it to the engine."},"140":{"id":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/how-home-works-13","page_id":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/how-home-works","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/how-home-works#-what-happens-when-someone-asks-a-question","content":"The engine answers. Home checks the reply against the person's age band before showing it."},"141":{"id":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/how-home-works-14","page_id":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/how-home-works","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/how-home-works#-what-happens-when-someone-asks-a-question","content":"Home stores the conversation in its own folder."},"142":{"id":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/how-home-works-15","page_id":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/how-home-works","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/how-home-works#-what-happens-when-someone-asks-a-question","content":"If the engine is unreachable, chat pauses and Repairs shows why. Nothing is sent elsewhere as a fallback."},"143":{"id":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/how-home-works-16","page_id":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/how-home-works","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/how-home-works#-what-this-means-for-you","content":"Your household's data stays in one folder you can back up. See Where your data lives."},"144":{"id":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/how-home-works-17","page_id":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/how-home-works","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/how-home-works#-what-this-means-for-you","content":"Safety is built into Home, not into a package. Child protections cannot be removed. See Safety settings."},"145":{"id":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/how-home-works-18","page_id":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/how-home-works","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/how-home-works#-what-this-means-for-you","content":"Home does not phone home. Every outbound connection is listed on the Privacy page. See Privacy audit."},"146":{"id":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/how-home-works-19","page_id":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/how-home-works","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/how-home-works#-where-things-are-in-the-app","content":"The main menu has **Home**, **Chat**, **Family**, **Privacy** and **Settings**. Admin work lives under **Settings**, in the **Home settings** area. Backups, Updates, Repairs, Status, Storage and Engines are pages you reach from Settings."},"147":{"id":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/how-home-works-20","page_id":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/how-home-works","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/how-home-works#-where-things-are-in-the-app","content":"<Callout type=\"info\">The sidebar in some screenshots still says People. That page is now called Family.</Callout>"},"148":{"id":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/people-roles-and-permissions","page_id":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/people-roles-and-permissions","type":"page","content":"People, roles and permissions","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Admin guide","🧩 How it works"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/people-roles-and-permissions"},"149":{"id":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/people-roles-and-permissions-0","page_id":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/people-roles-and-permissions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/people-roles-and-permissions","content":"The six roles, what each can do, and what an admin can never see."},"150":{"id":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/people-roles-and-permissions-1","page_id":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/people-roles-and-permissions","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/people-roles-and-permissions#-the-six-roles","content":"🪜 The six roles"},"151":{"id":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/people-roles-and-permissions-2","page_id":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/people-roles-and-permissions","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/people-roles-and-permissions#-what-only-the-owner-can-do","content":"🔑 What only the owner can do"},"152":{"id":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/people-roles-and-permissions-3","page_id":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/people-roles-and-permissions","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/people-roles-and-permissions#️-what-admins-cannot-see","content":"🛡️ What admins cannot see"},"153":{"id":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/people-roles-and-permissions-4","page_id":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/people-roles-and-permissions","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/people-roles-and-permissions#-settings-that-follow-the-role","content":"🔒 Settings that follow the role"},"154":{"id":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/people-roles-and-permissions-5","page_id":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/people-roles-and-permissions","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/people-roles-and-permissions#-check-it-yourself","content":"🧪 Check it yourself"},"155":{"id":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/people-roles-and-permissions-6","page_id":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/people-roles-and-permissions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/people-roles-and-permissions","content":"Every person in Home has one role. The role decides what they can open, change and see."},"156":{"id":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/people-roles-and-permissions-7","page_id":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/people-roles-and-permissions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/people-roles-and-permissions#-the-six-roles","content":"From most to least control: **owner**, **admin**, **adult**, **teen**, **child**, **guest**."},"157":{"id":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/people-roles-and-permissions-8","page_id":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/people-roles-and-permissions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/people-roles-and-permissions#-the-six-roles","content":"| Role  | Sign-in         | Runs the house                | Reads others' private data |\n| ----- | --------------- | ----------------------------- | -------------------------- |\n| Owner | PIN or password | Everything, including restore | Own, plus a child's        |","table":"table-0"},"158":{"id":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/people-roles-and-permissions-9","page_id":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/people-roles-and-permissions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/people-roles-and-permissions#-the-six-roles","content":"| Role  | Sign-in         | Runs the house                     | Reads others' private data |\n| ----- | --------------- | ---------------------------------- | -------------------------- |\n| Admin | PIN or password | Settings, people, backups, updates | Own, plus a child's        |","table":"table-0"},"159":{"id":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/people-roles-and-permissions-10","page_id":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/people-roles-and-permissions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/people-roles-and-permissions#-the-six-roles","content":"| Role  | Sign-in         | Runs the house | Reads others' private data |\n| ----- | --------------- | -------------- | -------------------------- |\n| Adult | PIN or password | No             | Own only                   |","table":"table-0"},"160":{"id":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/people-roles-and-permissions-11","page_id":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/people-roles-and-permissions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/people-roles-and-permissions#-the-six-roles","content":"| Role | Sign-in       | Runs the house | Reads others' private data |\n| ---- | ------------- | -------------- | -------------------------- |\n| Teen | None required | No             | Own only                   |","table":"table-0"},"161":{"id":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/people-roles-and-permissions-12","page_id":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/people-roles-and-permissions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/people-roles-and-permissions#-the-six-roles","content":"| Role  | Sign-in       | Runs the house | Reads others' private data |\n| ----- | ------------- | -------------- | -------------------------- |\n| Child | None required | No             | Own only; a parent sees it |","table":"table-0"},"162":{"id":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/people-roles-and-permissions-13","page_id":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/people-roles-and-permissions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/people-roles-and-permissions#-the-six-roles","content":"| Role  | Sign-in       | Runs the house | Reads others' private data |\n| ----- | ------------- | -------------- | -------------------------- |\n| Guest | None required | No             | None                       |","table":"table-0"},"163":{"id":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/people-roles-and-permissions-14","page_id":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/people-roles-and-permissions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/people-roles-and-permissions#-what-only-the-owner-can-do","content":"Create another owner or an admin. An admin can add adults, teens, children and guests."},"164":{"id":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/people-roles-and-permissions-15","page_id":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/people-roles-and-permissions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/people-roles-and-permissions#-what-only-the-owner-can-do","content":"Change a person's role. Nobody can change their own role."},"165":{"id":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/people-roles-and-permissions-16","page_id":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/people-roles-and-permissions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/people-roles-and-permissions#-what-only-the-owner-can-do","content":"Restore a backup. An admin can see the backup list and run one."},"166":{"id":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/people-roles-and-permissions-17","page_id":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/people-roles-and-permissions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/people-roles-and-permissions#-what-only-the-owner-can-do","content":"Home refuses to remove or demote the household's only owner. Make someone else an owner first."},"167":{"id":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/people-roles-and-permissions-18","page_id":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/people-roles-and-permissions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/people-roles-and-permissions#️-what-admins-cannot-see","content":"An owner or admin can open a **child's** profile, memories and settings. A **teen's** profile does not open at all for them, from Family or by typing its address. They cannot see another adult's memories or settings. A teen's chats and settings stay private from admins. This is built in and has no switch."},"168":{"id":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/people-roles-and-permissions-19","page_id":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/people-roles-and-permissions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/people-roles-and-permissions#️-what-admins-cannot-see","content":"Household-wide switches still apply to every teen, such as **Web search with teen controls** under Settings, Search. Those change what Home does for teens as a group. They never show an admin what a teen asked."},"169":{"id":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/people-roles-and-permissions-20","page_id":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/people-roles-and-permissions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/people-roles-and-permissions#-settings-that-follow-the-role","content":"**Household settings** are writable only by an owner or admin."},"170":{"id":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/people-roles-and-permissions-21","page_id":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/people-roles-and-permissions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/people-roles-and-permissions#-settings-that-follow-the-role","content":"**Session lock** (ask for the PIN again after idle time) is set by an owner or admin, from the people list in Settings, Users."},"171":{"id":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/people-roles-and-permissions-22","page_id":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/people-roles-and-permissions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/people-roles-and-permissions#-settings-that-follow-the-role","content":"A child's **Sensitive subjects** levels are set only by an owner or admin. The child cannot change them."},"172":{"id":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/people-roles-and-permissions-23","page_id":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/people-roles-and-permissions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/people-roles-and-permissions#-settings-that-follow-the-role","content":"Each person's own look, voice and notification settings belong to that person."},"173":{"id":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/people-roles-and-permissions-24","page_id":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/people-roles-and-permissions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/people-roles-and-permissions#-check-it-yourself","content":"Open **Family** as the admin."},"174":{"id":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/people-roles-and-permissions-25","page_id":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/people-roles-and-permissions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/people-roles-and-permissions#-check-it-yourself","content":"Open a child's card. You see **Overview**, **Memories**, **Limits** and **Topics**."},"175":{"id":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/people-roles-and-permissions-26","page_id":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/people-roles-and-permissions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/people-roles-and-permissions#-check-it-yourself","content":"Look at a teen's card in **Family**. It is not a link, and a typed address shows a \"You cannot open this profile\" message, so there is no **Limits**, **Topics** or **Memories** tab and no teen chats or memories are shown."},"176":{"id":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/people-roles-and-permissions-27","page_id":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/people-roles-and-permissions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/people-roles-and-permissions#-check-it-yourself","content":"For what each role sees day to day, see What each role can do."},"177":{"id":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/where-your-data-lives","page_id":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/where-your-data-lives","type":"page","content":"Where your data lives","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Admin guide","🧩 How it works"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/where-your-data-lives"},"178":{"id":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/where-your-data-lives-0","page_id":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/where-your-data-lives","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/where-your-data-lives","content":"Every folder Home writes, what is in it, and which folders a backup covers."},"179":{"id":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/where-your-data-lives-1","page_id":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/where-your-data-lives","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/where-your-data-lives#-what-is-in-each-folder","content":"📁 What is in each folder"},"180":{"id":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/where-your-data-lives-2","page_id":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/where-your-data-lives","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/where-your-data-lives#-what-a-backup-covers","content":"💾 What a backup covers"},"181":{"id":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/where-your-data-lives-3","page_id":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/where-your-data-lives","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/where-your-data-lives#-move-or-remove","content":"🧹 Move or remove"},"182":{"id":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/where-your-data-lives-4","page_id":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/where-your-data-lives","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/where-your-data-lives#️-before-you-delete-a-folder-you-do-not-recognise","content":"⚠️ Before you delete a folder you do not recognise"},"183":{"id":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/where-your-data-lives-5","page_id":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/where-your-data-lives","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/where-your-data-lives","content":"Home keeps everything in one **data folder**. The default is a folder named `data` at the top of the Home folder. Two backup folders sit beside it, not inside it."},"184":{"id":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/where-your-data-lives-6","page_id":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/where-your-data-lives","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/where-your-data-lives#-what-is-in-each-folder","content":"| Folder                             | What it holds                                                  | Replaceable?      |\n| ---------------------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------- | ----------------- |\n| `records` (the data folder itself) | People, memories, conversations, settings in one database file | No. Back this up. |","table":"table-0"},"185":{"id":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/where-your-data-lives-7","page_id":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/where-your-data-lives","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/where-your-data-lives#-what-is-in-each-folder","content":"| Folder | What it holds                               | Replaceable?                                 |\n| ------ | ------------------------------------------- | -------------------------------------------- |\n| `keys` | Encryption keys for secrets and face prints | No. Keep on a disk that is always connected. |","table":"table-0"},"186":{"id":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/where-your-data-lives-8","page_id":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/where-your-data-lives","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/where-your-data-lives#-what-is-in-each-folder","content":"| Folder   | What it holds       | Replaceable? |\n| -------- | ------------------- | ------------ |\n| `people` | Each person's files | No           |","table":"table-0"},"187":{"id":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/where-your-data-lives-9","page_id":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/where-your-data-lives","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/where-your-data-lives#-what-is-in-each-folder","content":"| Folder         | What it holds | Replaceable? |\n| -------------- | ------------- | ------------ |\n| `voice/cloned` | Cloned voices | No           |","table":"table-0"},"188":{"id":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/where-your-data-lives-10","page_id":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/where-your-data-lives","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/where-your-data-lives#-what-is-in-each-folder","content":"| Folder     | What it holds | Replaceable? |\n| ---------- | ------------- | ------------ |\n| `projects` | Project files | No           |","table":"table-0"},"189":{"id":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/where-your-data-lives-11","page_id":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/where-your-data-lives","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/where-your-data-lives#-what-is-in-each-folder","content":"| Folder     | What it holds | Replaceable? |\n| ---------- | ------------- | ------------ |\n| `packages` | Package data  | Mostly       |","table":"table-0"},"190":{"id":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/where-your-data-lives-12","page_id":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/where-your-data-lives","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/where-your-data-lives#-what-is-in-each-folder","content":"| Folder                          | What it holds                                     | Replaceable?          |\n| ------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------- | --------------------- |\n| `models`, `engines`, `sidecars` | Downloaded AI models, engines and helper programs | Yes, downloaded again |","table":"table-0"},"191":{"id":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/where-your-data-lives-13","page_id":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/where-your-data-lives","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/where-your-data-lives#-what-is-in-each-folder","content":"| Folder      | What it holds                 | Replaceable?          |\n| ----------- | ----------------------------- | --------------------- |\n| `reference` | The offline reference library | Yes, downloaded again |","table":"table-0"},"192":{"id":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/where-your-data-lives-14","page_id":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/where-your-data-lives","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/where-your-data-lives#-what-is-in-each-folder","content":"| Folder  | What it holds      | Replaceable? |\n| ------- | ------------------ | ------------ |\n| `lists` | Blocked-site lists | Yes          |","table":"table-0"},"193":{"id":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/where-your-data-lives-15","page_id":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/where-your-data-lives","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/where-your-data-lives#-what-is-in-each-folder","content":"| Folder                                          | What it holds                                 | Replaceable? |\n| ----------------------------------------------- | --------------------------------------------- | ------------ |\n| `voice/stt`, `voice/wakewords`, `vision/models` | Speech, wake-word and face recognition models | Yes          |","table":"table-0"},"194":{"id":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/where-your-data-lives-16","page_id":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/where-your-data-lives","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/where-your-data-lives#-what-is-in-each-folder","content":"| Folder                                                              | What it holds                  | Replaceable? |\n| ------------------------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------ | ------------ |\n| `logs`, `cache`, `favicons`, `answer-images`, `local-app`, `labels` | Logs, caches and runtime files | Yes          |","table":"table-0"},"195":{"id":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/where-your-data-lives-17","page_id":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/where-your-data-lives","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/where-your-data-lives#-what-is-in-each-folder","content":"| Folder                             | What it holds               | Replaceable? |\n| ---------------------------------- | --------------------------- | ------------ |\n| `backups` (beside the data folder) | Your encrypted backup files | See below    |","table":"table-0"},"196":{"id":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/where-your-data-lives-18","page_id":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/where-your-data-lives","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/where-your-data-lives#-what-is-in-each-folder","content":"| Folder                                      | What it holds                    | Replaceable?               |\n| ------------------------------------------- | -------------------------------- | -------------------------- |\n| `received-backups` (beside the data folder) | Backups pushed by paired devices | Not yet used by the app UI |","table":"table-0"},"197":{"id":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/where-your-data-lives-19","page_id":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/where-your-data-lives","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/where-your-data-lives#-what-is-in-each-folder","content":"Put `records` and `backups` on different disks. A backup on the same disk is no safer than the data it copies."},"198":{"id":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/where-your-data-lives-20","page_id":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/where-your-data-lives","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/where-your-data-lives#-what-a-backup-covers","content":"Today a backup is an encrypted copy of the household database: people, memories, conversations and settings. It does not include models, engines, the reference library or people's uploaded files. Those are downloaded or copied again after a restore. See Backups and restore."},"199":{"id":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/where-your-data-lives-21","page_id":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/where-your-data-lives","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/where-your-data-lives#-move-or-remove","content":"The Storage page shows what each person uses and the caps."},"200":{"id":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/where-your-data-lives-22","page_id":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/where-your-data-lives","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/where-your-data-lives#-move-or-remove","content":"To change where a folder lives, there is no screen yet. Planned, not in the app yet: the data-location picker. The setup wizard says so too."},"201":{"id":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/where-your-data-lives-23","page_id":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/where-your-data-lives","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/where-your-data-lives#-move-or-remove","content":"To uninstall, run the uninstall script. It asks before it deletes anything, and every prompt defaults to keep. See Install and start."},"202":{"id":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/where-your-data-lives-24","page_id":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/where-your-data-lives","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/how-it-works/where-your-data-lives#️-before-you-delete-a-folder-you-do-not-recognise","content":"A folder that looks stray may be live household data. Open it first and check what it holds. Never delete `records` or `keys` without a backup and the backup key."},"203":{"id":"/docs/admin","page_id":"/docs/admin","type":"page","content":"Admin guide 🛠️","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Admin guide"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/admin"},"204":{"id":"/docs/admin-0","page_id":"/docs/admin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin","content":"For the person who runs the house. How MaiPai Home works, how to set it up, and how to look after it."},"205":{"id":"/docs/admin-1","page_id":"/docs/admin","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/admin#-how-it-works","content":"🧩 How it works"},"206":{"id":"/docs/admin-2","page_id":"/docs/admin","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/admin#-install-and-set-up","content":"🧰 Install and set up"},"207":{"id":"/docs/admin-3","page_id":"/docs/admin","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/admin#-people-and-safety","content":"👨‍👩‍👧 People and safety"},"208":{"id":"/docs/admin-4","page_id":"/docs/admin","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/admin#-connect-and-extend","content":"🔌 Connect and extend"},"209":{"id":"/docs/admin-5","page_id":"/docs/admin","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/admin#-look-after-it","content":"🩺 Look after it"},"210":{"id":"/doc