race","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/admin/look-after-it/turn-trace#-still-need-help","content":"🙋 Still need help?"},"720":{"id":"/docs/admin/look-after-it/turn-trace-4","page_id":"/docs/admin/look-after-it/turn-trace","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/look-after-it/turn-trace","content":"This page is for owners and admins."},"721":{"id":"/docs/admin/look-after-it/turn-trace-5","page_id":"/docs/admin/look-after-it/turn-trace","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/look-after-it/turn-trace#️-steps","content":"In Chat, find the reply you want to look at and tap the **More** (three dots) button under it."},"722":{"id":"/docs/admin/look-after-it/turn-trace-6","page_id":"/docs/admin/look-after-it/turn-trace","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/look-after-it/turn-trace#️-steps","content":"Tap **Turn trace**."},"723":{"id":"/docs/admin/look-after-it/turn-trace-7","page_id":"/docs/admin/look-after-it/turn-trace","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/look-after-it/turn-trace#️-steps","content":"Read the **Turn trace** page. The **Trace** card lists each step as a bar, with the total time in milliseconds."},"724":{"id":"/docs/admin/look-after-it/turn-trace-8","page_id":"/docs/admin/look-after-it/turn-trace","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/look-after-it/turn-trace#️-steps","content":"Steps include the pipeline stages, **Model generation** and **Tool call**. Each can be completed, failed, skipped or running."},"725":{"id":"/docs/admin/look-after-it/turn-trace-9","page_id":"/docs/admin/look-after-it/turn-trace","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/look-after-it/turn-trace#-what-it-never-shows","content":"A trace holds names and timings only. It has no message text, no tool details and no names of people. A turn from a temporary or Incognito chat has no trace."},"726":{"id":"/docs/admin/look-after-it/turn-trace-10","page_id":"/docs/admin/look-after-it/turn-trace","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/look-after-it/turn-trace#-what-it-never-shows","content":"**Turn trace** shows only for owners and admins, and not in an Incognito chat. You can also open `/trace/` followed by a turn's id on your Home address."},"727":{"id":"/docs/admin/look-after-it/turn-trace-11","page_id":"/docs/admin/look-after-it/turn-trace","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/look-after-it/turn-trace#-what-it-never-shows","content":"If it cannot load, it says \"Could not load this trace.\" Tap **Try again**. A not-found answer means the turn is unknown or was private."},"728":{"id":"/docs/admin/look-after-it/turn-trace-12","page_id":"/docs/admin/look-after-it/turn-trace","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/look-after-it/turn-trace#-still-need-help","content":"For overall timing, use Performance."},"729":{"id":"/docs/admin/look-after-it/updates-and-rollback","page_id":"/docs/admin/look-after-it/updates-and-rollback","type":"page","content":"Updates and rollback","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Admin guide","🩺 Look after it"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/admin/look-after-it/updates-and-rollback"},"730":{"id":"/docs/admin/look-after-it/updates-and-rollback-0","page_id":"/docs/admin/look-after-it/updates-and-rollback","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/look-after-it/updates-and-rollback","content":"How Home finds updates, how to update by hand, and how engine updates are applied and undone."},"731":{"id":"/docs/admin/look-after-it/updates-and-rollback-1","page_id":"/docs/admin/look-after-it/updates-and-rollback","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/admin/look-after-it/updates-and-rollback#-what-home-checks","content":"🔍 What Home checks"},"732":{"id":"/docs/admin/look-after-it/updates-and-rollback-2","page_id":"/docs/admin/look-after-it/updates-and-rollback","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/admin/look-after-it/updates-and-rollback#️-update-home","content":"🛠️ Update Home"},"733":{"id":"/docs/admin/look-after-it/updates-and-rollback-3","page_id":"/docs/admin/look-after-it/updates-and-rollback","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/admin/look-after-it/updates-and-rollback#️-engines","content":"⚙️ Engines"},"734":{"id":"/docs/admin/look-after-it/updates-and-rollback-4","page_id":"/docs/admin/look-after-it/updates-and-rollback","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/admin/look-after-it/updates-and-rollback#-get-told","content":"📣 Get told"},"735":{"id":"/docs/admin/look-after-it/updates-and-rollback-5","page_id":"/docs/admin/look-after-it/updates-and-rollback","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/admin/look-after-it/updates-and-rollback#-if-the-check-shows-nothing","content":"🔧 If the check shows nothing"},"736":{"id":"/docs/admin/look-after-it/updates-and-rollback-6","page_id":"/docs/admin/look-after-it/updates-and-rollback","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/look-after-it/updates-and-rollback#-what-home-checks","content":"Home asks GitHub once a day for the latest MaiPai Home release. If a robot is paired, it also checks the bot release. It sends no name or device ID."},"737":{"id":"/docs/admin/look-after-it/updates-and-rollback-7","page_id":"/docs/admin/look-after-it/updates-and-rollback","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/look-after-it/updates-and-rollback#-what-home-checks","content":"Open **Settings**, **Home settings**, **Maintenance**, then **Updates**. The table has **Name**, **Installed**, **Available**, **Last checked** and **Status**. A row says **Up to date** or shows the newer version."},"738":{"id":"/docs/admin/look-after-it/updates-and-rollback-8","page_id":"/docs/admin/look-after-it/updates-and-rollback","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/look-after-it/updates-and-rollback#-what-home-checks","content":"Only an owner or admin can manage updates."},"739":{"id":"/docs/admin/look-after-it/updates-and-rollback-9","page_id":"/docs/admin/look-after-it/updates-and-rollback","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/look-after-it/updates-and-rollback#️-update-home","content":"Planned, not in the app yet: installing a Home update from this page. Home shows that one is available. You update it by hand."},"740":{"id":"/docs/admin/look-after-it/updates-and-rollback-10","page_id":"/docs/admin/look-after-it/updates-and-rollback","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/look-after-it/updates-and-rollback#️-update-home","content":"Take a backup first. See Backups and restore."},"741":{"id":"/docs/admin/look-after-it/updates-and-rollback-11","page_id":"/docs/admin/look-after-it/updates-and-rollback","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/look-after-it/updates-and-rollback#️-update-home","content":"Stop Home. If you run it from source, run `bun stop` in the Home folder. If you used the installer, stop the `maipai-home` service."},"742":{"id":"/docs/admin/look-after-it/updates-and-rollback-12","page_id":"/docs/admin/look-after-it/updates-and-rollback","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/look-after-it/updates-and-rollback#️-update-home","content":"Install the new release from the GitHub release page, or pull the new tag if you run from source."},"743":{"id":"/docs/admin/look-after-it/updates-and-rollback-13","page_id":"/docs/admin/look-after-it/updates-and-rollback","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/look-after-it/updates-and-rollback#️-update-home","content":"Run `bun install --force` if you run from source."},"744":{"id":"/docs/admin/look-after-it/updates-and-rollback-14","page_id":"/docs/admin/look-after-it/updates-and-rollback","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/look-after-it/updates-and-rollback#️-update-home","content":"Start Home again."},"745":{"id":"/docs/admin/look-after-it/updates-and-rollback-15","page_id":"/docs/admin/look-after-it/updates-and-rollback","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/look-after-it/updates-and-rollback#️-update-home","content":"Open **Updates** and check **Installed** shows the new version."},"746":{"id":"/docs/admin/look-after-it/updates-and-rollback-16","page_id":"/docs/admin/look-after-it/updates-and-rollback","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/look-after-it/updates-and-rollback#️-update-home","content":"Planned, not in the app yet: a fixed update window and a kept previous release for one-click rollback of Home itself. To go back today, reinstall the earlier release and, if the data changed, restore the backup from step 1."},"747":{"id":"/docs/admin/look-after-it/updates-and-rollback-17","page_id":"/docs/admin/look-after-it/updates-and-rollback","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/look-after-it/updates-and-rollback#️-engines","content":"Rows for the AI engines (the Stack) have two buttons:"},"748":{"id":"/docs/admin/look-after-it/updates-and-rollback-18","page_id":"/docs/admin/look-after-it/updates-and-rollback","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/look-after-it/updates-and-rollback#️-engines","content":"**Apply** installs the update."},"749":{"id":"/docs/admin/look-after-it/updates-and-rollback-19","page_id":"/docs/admin/look-after-it/updates-and-rollback","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/look-after-it/updates-and-rollback#️-engines","content":"**Go back** returns to the previous version after you confirm."},"750":{"id":"/docs/admin/look-after-it/updates-and-rollback-20","page_id":"/docs/admin/look-after-it/updates-and-rollback","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/look-after-it/updates-and-rollback#️-engines","content":"Choosing how reference library updates run, and capping their download speed, is planned, not available yet. The two settings exist but have no effect today."},"751":{"id":"/docs/admin/look-after-it/updates-and-rollback-21","page_id":"/docs/admin/look-after-it/updates-and-rollback","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/look-after-it/updates-and-rollback#-get-told","content":"Tick **Telegram me when a MaiPai Home update is available** and the engine update switches in your Notifications settings. See Notifications and Telegram."},"752":{"id":"/docs/admin/look-after-it/updates-and-rollback-22","page_id":"/docs/admin/look-after-it/updates-and-rollback","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/look-after-it/updates-and-rollback#-if-the-check-shows-nothing","content":"Home may have no internet, or GitHub may have limited the request. Wait a day and look again. Open **Repairs** for anything Home flags."},"753":{"id":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/add-people-and-parental-controls","page_id":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/add-people-and-parental-controls","type":"page","content":"Add people and parental controls","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Admin guide","👪 People and safety"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/add-people-and-parental-controls"},"754":{"id":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/add-people-and-parental-controls-0","page_id":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/add-people-and-parental-controls","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/add-people-and-parental-controls","content":"Add a person, pick a role, and set a child's time limits and storage."},"755":{"id":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/add-people-and-parental-controls-1","page_id":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/add-people-and-parental-controls","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/add-people-and-parental-controls#-add-a-person","content":"👤 Add a person"},"756":{"id":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/add-people-and-parental-controls-2","page_id":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/add-people-and-parental-controls","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/add-people-and-parental-controls#️-change-a-role-or-remove-someone","content":"✏️ Change a role or remove someone"},"757":{"id":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/add-people-and-parental-controls-3","page_id":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/add-people-and-parental-controls","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/add-people-and-parental-controls#-a-childs-controls","content":"🧒 A child's controls"},"758":{"id":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/add-people-and-parental-controls-4","page_id":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/add-people-and-parental-controls","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/add-people-and-parental-controls#-a-teens-controls","content":"🧑 A teen's controls"},"759":{"id":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/add-people-and-parental-controls-5","page_id":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/add-people-and-parental-controls","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/add-people-and-parental-controls#-when-a-child-has-a-hard-moment","content":"🤝 When a child has a hard moment"},"760":{"id":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/add-people-and-parental-controls-6","page_id":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/add-people-and-parental-controls","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/add-people-and-parental-controls#-support","content":"🙋 Support"},"761":{"id":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/add-people-and-parental-controls-7","page_id":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/add-people-and-parental-controls","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/add-people-and-parental-controls","content":"This page is for owners and admins."},"762":{"id":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/add-people-and-parental-controls-8","page_id":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/add-people-and-parental-controls","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/add-people-and-parental-controls#-add-a-person","content":"Open **Settings**, then **Home settings**, then **Users**."},"763":{"id":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/add-people-and-parental-controls-9","page_id":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/add-people-and-parental-controls","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/add-people-and-parental-controls#-add-a-person","content":"Under **Add someone**, type the person's name."},"764":{"id":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/add-people-and-parental-controls-10","page_id":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/add-people-and-parental-controls","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/add-people-and-parental-controls#-add-a-person","content":"Pick a **Role**. The list shows only the roles you may create. An admin sees adult, teen, child and guest. An owner also sees admin and owner."},"765":{"id":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/add-people-and-parental-controls-11","page_id":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/add-people-and-parental-controls","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/add-people-and-parental-controls#-add-a-person","content":"For an owner, admin or adult, type a **PIN or password**. They use it to sign in. Teens, children and guests need none."},"766":{"id":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/add-people-and-parental-controls-12","page_id":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/add-people-and-parental-controls","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/add-people-and-parental-controls#-add-a-person","content":"Press **Add to household**."},"767":{"id":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/add-people-and-parental-controls-13","page_id":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/add-people-and-parental-controls","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/add-people-and-parental-controls#-add-a-person","content":"If you skip the PIN for a role that needs one, Home says \"This role requires a PIN or password. Enter one above, then try again.\" If something else fails, Home says \"Could not add that person.\" Check the name is filled in, then try again."},"768":{"id":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/add-people-and-parental-controls-14","page_id":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/add-people-and-parental-controls","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/add-people-and-parental-controls#-add-a-person","content":"The person's age group follows the role. A child gets child controls, a teen gets teen controls. See People, roles and permissions."},"769":{"id":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/add-people-and-parental-controls-15","page_id":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/add-people-and-parental-controls","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/add-people-and-parental-controls#️-change-a-role-or-remove-someone","content":"Only the owner can change a role. Open **Users** and pick the new role next to the name."},"770":{"id":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/add-people-and-parental-controls-16","page_id":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/add-people-and-parental-controls","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/add-people-and-parental-controls#️-change-a-role-or-remove-someone","content":"To lock a person's session after idle time, tick **Require PIN lock** next to the name and set the timeout in minutes. The default is 5."},"771":{"id":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/add-people-and-parental-controls-17","page_id":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/add-people-and-parental-controls","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/add-people-and-parental-controls#️-change-a-role-or-remove-someone","content":"To remove someone, press **Remove**, then **Yes, remove**. Home shows how many files only that person could see. Those files are deleted with them. Files other people can see stay with the household. For a child, you can download their files first. A person's own files are private, so ask an adult to save theirs."},"772":{"id":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/add-people-and-parental-controls-18","page_id":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/add-people-and-parental-controls","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/add-people-and-parental-controls#️-change-a-role-or-remove-someone","content":"Home will not remove or demote the only owner."},"773":{"id":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/add-people-and-parental-controls-19","page_id":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/add-people-and-parental-controls","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/add-people-and-parental-controls#-a-childs-controls","content":"Open **Family**, then the child's card. Two tabs are only for owners and admins:"},"774":{"id":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/add-people-and-parental-controls-20","page_id":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/add-people-and-parental-controls","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/add-people-and-parental-controls#-a-childs-controls","content":"| Tab        | What you set                                                                                                                                                                                         |\n| ---------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Limits** | Daily minutes for each kind of app (Family, Fun, Health, Home, Info, Learning, Media, Robot body, Utilities). 0 means no limit. The minutes are saved but not applied yet. Also the child's storage. |","table":"table-0"},"775":{"id":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/add-people-and-parental-controls-21","page_id":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/add-people-and-parental-controls","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/add-people-and-parental-controls#-a-childs-controls","content":"| Tab        | What you set                                 |\n| ---------- | -------------------------------------------- |\n| **Topics** | **Sensitive subjects**. See Safety settings. |","table":"table-0"},"776":{"id":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/add-people-and-parental-controls-22","page_id":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/add-people-and-parental-controls","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/add-people-and-parental-controls#-a-childs-controls","content":"Changes save as you make them. The child cannot open either tab."},"777":{"id":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/add-people-and-parental-controls-23","page_id":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/add-people-and-parental-controls","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/add-people-and-parental-controls#-a-teens-controls","content":"There is no per-teen screen. Teen settings are household-wide and sit under Settings, Privacy and Search. A teen's own profile, chats and settings are private from admins."},"778":{"id":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/add-people-and-parental-controls-24","page_id":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/add-people-and-parental-controls","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/add-people-and-parental-controls#-when-a-child-has-a-hard-moment","content":"Every adult gets a notice that \"A check-in may help.\" It names the child and not what was said. This cannot be turned off."},"779":{"id":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/add-people-and-parental-controls-25","page_id":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/add-people-and-parental-controls","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/add-people-and-parental-controls#-support","content":"Someone cannot sign in: see Cannot sign in."},"780":{"id":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/add-people-and-parental-controls-26","page_id":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/add-people-and-parental-controls","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/add-people-and-parental-controls#-support","content":"To see what each role sees, see What each role can do."},"781":{"id":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/blocked-sites-and-news-feeds","page_id":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/blocked-sites-and-news-feeds","type":"page","content":"Blocked-site lists and news feeds","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Admin guide","👪 People and safety"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/blocked-sites-and-news-feeds"},"782":{"id":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/blocked-sites-and-news-feeds-0","page_id":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/blocked-sites-and-news-feeds","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/blocked-sites-and-news-feeds","content":"Choose which site lists apply to children and teens, add your own rules, and pick the news a child sees."},"783":{"id":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/blocked-sites-and-news-feeds-1","page_id":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/blocked-sites-and-news-feeds","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/blocked-sites-and-news-feeds#-blocked-site-lists","content":"🚫 Blocked-site lists"},"784":{"id":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/blocked-sites-and-news-feeds-2","page_id":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/blocked-sites-and-news-feeds","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/blocked-sites-and-news-feeds#️-change-a-list-for-one-person","content":"✍️ Change a list for one person"},"785":{"id":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/blocked-sites-and-news-feeds-3","page_id":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/blocked-sites-and-news-feeds","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/blocked-sites-and-news-feeds#-your-own-site-rules","content":"🌐 Your own site rules"},"786":{"id":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/blocked-sites-and-news-feeds-4","page_id":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/blocked-sites-and-news-feeds","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/blocked-sites-and-news-feeds#-news-feeds","content":"📰 News feeds"},"787":{"id":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/blocked-sites-and-news-feeds-5","page_id":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/blocked-sites-and-news-feeds","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/blocked-sites-and-news-feeds#-when-a-list-does-not-download","content":"🔧 When a list does not download"},"788":{"id":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/blocked-sites-and-news-feeds-6","page_id":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/blocked-sites-and-news-feeds","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/blocked-sites-and-news-feeds","content":"This page is for owners and admins."},"789":{"id":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/blocked-sites-and-news-feeds-7","page_id":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/blocked-sites-and-news-feeds","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/blocked-sites-and-news-feeds#-blocked-site-lists","content":"Web search checks every result against lists of sites that are blocked for the age group. Home downloads the lists from The Block List Project and refreshes them about monthly. It asks for the list index about daily. Neither request carries a name or device ID."},"790":{"id":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/blocked-sites-and-news-feeds-8","page_id":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/blocked-sites-and-news-feeds","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/blocked-sites-and-news-feeds#-blocked-site-lists","content":"| List            | Child      | Teen       | Adult |\n| --------------- | ---------- | ---------- | ----- |\n| **Adult sites** | On, locked | On, locked | Off   |","table":"table-0"},"791":{"id":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/blocked-sites-and-news-feeds-9","page_id":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/blocked-sites-and-news-feeds","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/blocked-sites-and-news-feeds#-blocked-site-lists","content":"| List               | Child | Teen | Adult |\n| ------------------ | ----- | ---- | ----- |\n| **Gambling sites** | On    | On   | Off   |","table":"table-0"},"792":{"id":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/blocked-sites-and-news-feeds-10","page_id":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/blocked-sites-and-news-feeds","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/blocked-sites-and-news-feeds#-blocked-site-lists","content":"| List           | Child | Teen | Adult |\n| -------------- | ----- | ---- | ----- |\n| **Scam sites** | On    | On   | Off   |","table":"table-0"},"793":{"id":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/blocked-sites-and-news-feeds-11","page_id":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/blocked-sites-and-news-feeds","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/blocked-sites-and-news-feeds#-blocked-site-lists","content":"| List               | Child | Teen | Adult |\n| ------------------ | ----- | ---- | ----- |\n| **Phishing sites** | On    | On   | Off   |","table":"table-0"},"794":{"i