url":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/blocked-sites-and-news-feeds#️-change-a-list-for-one-person","content":"The left column shows the global defaults. Tick or untick a box in the person's column."},"800":{"id":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/blocked-sites-and-news-feeds-18","page_id":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/blocked-sites-and-news-feeds","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/blocked-sites-and-news-feeds#️-change-a-list-for-one-person","content":"To undo a change, use the reset link beside the row."},"801":{"id":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/blocked-sites-and-news-feeds-19","page_id":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/blocked-sites-and-news-feeds","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/blocked-sites-and-news-feeds#️-change-a-list-for-one-person","content":"Rows you cannot change are the age group's setting, or a block that always stays on."},"802":{"id":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/blocked-sites-and-news-feeds-20","page_id":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/blocked-sites-and-news-feeds","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/blocked-sites-and-news-feeds#-your-own-site-rules","content":"Under the advanced Search settings you can add sites by hand, separated by commas, such as `example.com`:"},"803":{"id":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/blocked-sites-and-news-feeds-21","page_id":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/blocked-sites-and-news-feeds","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/blocked-sites-and-news-feeds#-your-own-site-rules","content":"**Always block these sites** and **Allow these sites** apply to everyone."},"804":{"id":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/blocked-sites-and-news-feeds-22","page_id":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/blocked-sites-and-news-feeds","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/blocked-sites-and-news-feeds#-your-own-site-rules","content":"The same pair exists for child, teen and adult."},"805":{"id":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/blocked-sites-and-news-feeds-23","page_id":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/blocked-sites-and-news-feeds","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/blocked-sites-and-news-feeds#-your-own-site-rules","content":"An allow entry shows a site even when a list has it. Use it sparingly for children."},"806":{"id":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/blocked-sites-and-news-feeds-24","page_id":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/blocked-sites-and-news-feeds","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/blocked-sites-and-news-feeds#-news-feeds","content":"The News shelf on Home is on by default. Pick which feed lists each age group sees:"},"807":{"id":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/blocked-sites-and-news-feeds-25","page_id":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/blocked-sites-and-news-feeds","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/blocked-sites-and-news-feeds#-news-feeds","content":"| Setting                            | Default    |\n| ---------------------------------- | ---------- |\n| **News lists with child controls** | Kids' news |","table":"table-1"},"808":{"id":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/blocked-sites-and-news-feeds-26","page_id":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/blocked-sites-and-news-feeds","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/blocked-sites-and-news-feeds#-news-feeds","content":"| Setting                           | Default        |\n| --------------------------------- | -------------- |\n| **News lists with teen controls** | Household news |","table":"table-1"},"809":{"id":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/blocked-sites-and-news-feeds-27","page_id":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/blocked-sites-and-news-feeds","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/blocked-sites-and-news-feeds#-news-feeds","content":"| Setting                            | Default        |\n| ---------------------------------- | -------------- |\n| **News lists with adult controls** | Household news |","table":"table-1"},"810":{"id":"/d