d-safety/safety-settings-22","page_id":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/safety-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/safety-settings#️-what-you-can-change-for-a-child","content":"| Subject                              | Choices                                                                                     |\n| ------------------------------------ | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| Santa Claus and other family stories | **Keep the stories (recommended)** or **Don't keep them**; edit **Names of family stories** |","table":"table-0"},"838":{"id":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/safety-settings-23","page_id":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/safety-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/safety-settings#️-what-you-can-change-for-a-child","content":"Only an owner or admin can change these."},"839":{"id":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/safety-settings-24","page_id":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/safety-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/safety-settings#-what-you-can-change-for-every-teen","content":"These are household settings under **Settings**, then **Home settings**. The topic levels are under **Privacy**, the web search switch under **Search**, and the reply check under **Engines and AI**, **Chat**:"},"840":{"id":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/safety-settings-25","page_id":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/safety-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/safety-settings#-what-you-can-change-for-every-teen","content":"| Setting                                         | Default          | Effect                                                                                                  |\n| ----------------------------------------------- | ---------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Bodies and relationships with teen controls** | Answer factually | Factual and respectful, never sexual or romantic. Can be set to **Point to a trusted adult or doctor**. |","table":"table-1"},"841":{"id":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/safety-settings-26","page_id":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/safety-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/safety-settings#-what-you-can-change-for-every-teen","content":"| Setting                                           | Default                | Effect                                                                                            |\n| ------------------------------------------------- | ---------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Drugs, alcohol and betting with teen controls** | Explain the real risks | Real risks and how to get help, never tips. Can be set to **Point to a trusted adult or doctor**. |","table":"table-1"},"842":{"id":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/safety-settings-27","page_id":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/safety-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/safety-settings#-what-you-can-change-for-every-teen","content":"| Setting                           | Default | Effect                          |\n| --------------------------------- | ------- | ------------------------------- |\n| **Web search with teen controls** | On      | Off means offline library only. |","table":"table-1"},"843":{"id":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/safety-settings-28","page_id":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/safety-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/admin/people-and-safety/safety-settings#-what-you-can-change-for-every-teen","content":"| Setting                              | Default  | Effect                                                                                                                                                                     |\n| ---------------------------