/everyday-use/talk-instead-of-type-10","page_id":"/docs/user/everyday-use/talk-instead-of-type","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/user/everyday-use/talk-instead-of-type#️-steps-to-talk","content":"Check them, then send the message."},"1111":{"id":"/docs/user/everyday-use/talk-instead-of-type-11","page_id":"/docs/user/everyday-use/talk-instead-of-type","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/user/everyday-use/talk-instead-of-type#-hear-an-answer","content":"Under a reply, tap **Read aloud**. Tap **Stop reading** to quiet it. In the menu at the top, called **Conversation actions**, **Read replies aloud** reads every reply. You see it only when your house has a voice set up."},"1112":{"id":"/docs/user/everyday-use/talk-instead-of-type-12","page_id":"/docs/user/everyday-use/talk-instead-of-type","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/user/everyday-use/talk-instead-of-type#️-wake-word","content":"On a computer where the wake word files are installed, owners, admins and adults can turn on wake word listening so they do not have to tap. Teens, children and guests do not get it. It is off until you turn it on."},"1113":{"id":"/docs/user/everyday-use/talk-instead-of-type-13","page_id":"/docs/user/everyday-use/talk-instead-of-type","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/user/everyday-use/talk-instead-of-type#️-wake-word","content":"In a chat, tap the microphone button in the message box that says **Turn on wake word listening**. You do not see it if the files are not installed."},"1114":{"id":"/docs/user/everyday-use/talk-instead-of-type-14","page_id":"/docs/user/everyday-use/talk-instead-of-type","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/user/everyday-use/talk-instead-of-type#️-wake-word","content":"Allow the microphone if your browser asks."},"1115":{"id":"/docs/user/everyday-use/talk-instead-of-type-15","page_id":"/docs/user/everyday-use/talk-instead-of-type","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/user/everyday-use/talk-instead-of-type#️-wake-word","content":"Say \"Hey Jarvis\". That is the only wake word today, and you cannot change it. The voice conversation opens."},"1116":{"id":"/docs/user/everyday-use/talk-instead-of-type-16","page_id":"/docs/user/everyday-use/talk-instead-of-type","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/user/everyday-use/talk-instead-of-type#️-wake-word","content":"To stop, tap **Turn off wake word listening** in the red bar that says \"Listening for Hey Jarvis\"."},"1117":{"id":"/docs/user/everyday-use/talk-instead-of-type-17","page_id":"/docs/user/everyday-use/talk-instead-of-type","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/user/everyday-use/talk-instead-of-type#️-wake-word","content":"The setting belongs to this device, not to you. Listening is paused while a voice conversation is open and stops when you close the page."},"1118":{"id":"/docs/user/everyday-use/talk-instead-of-type-18","page_id":"/docs/user/everyday-use/talk-instead-of-type","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/user/everyday-use/talk-instead-of-type#️-wake-word","content":"<Callout type=\"info\">The microphone works only while the page is open and you have allowed it.</Callout>"},"1119":{"id":"/docs/user/everyday-use/talk-instead-of-type-19","page_id":"/docs/user/everyday-use/talk-instead-of-type","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/user/everyday-use/talk-instead-of-type#-still-need-help","content":"If it cannot hear you, see If voice does not work. An admin can set up voices: see Settings reference."},"1120":{"id":"/docs/user/everyday-use/use-incognito","page_id":"/docs/user/everyday-use/use-incognito","type":"page","content":"Use Incognito","breadcrumbs":["Docs","User guide","💬 Everyday use"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/user/everyday-use/use-incognito"},"1121":{"id":"/docs/user/everyday-use/use-incognito-0","page_id":"/docs/user/everyday-use/use-incognito","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/user/everyday-use/use-incognito","content":"Chat without saving anything, then let it all go."},"1122":{"id":"/docs/user/everyday-use/use-incognito-1","page_id":"/docs/user/everyday-use/use-incognito","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/user/everyday-use/use-incognito#️-steps","content":"✍️ Steps"},"1123":{"id":"/docs/user/everyday-use/use-incognito-2","page_id":"/docs/user/everyday-use/use-incognito","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/user/everyday-use/use-incognito#️-what-it-does","content":"🕶️ What it does"},"1124":{"id":"/docs/user/everyday-use/use-incognito-3","page_id":"/docs/user/everyday-use/use-incognito","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/user/everyday-use/use-incognito#-who-can-use-it","content":"👨‍👩‍👧 Who can use it"},"1125":{"id":"/docs/user/everyday-use/use-incognito-4","page_id":"/docs/user/everyday-use/use-incognito","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/user/everyday-use/use-incognito#-still-need-help","content":"🙋 Still need help?"},"1126":{"id":"/docs/user/everyday-use/use-incognito-5","page_id":"/docs/user/everyday-use/use-incognito","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/user/everyday-use/use-incognito#️-steps","content":"Tap your picture at the bottom of the left rail. The profile menu opens."},"1127":{"id":"/docs/user/everyday-use/use-incognito-6","page_id":"/docs/user/everyday-use/use-incognito","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/user/everyday-use/use-incognito#️-steps","content":"Tap **Incognito**. It shows **On**, and your picture gets a purple ring."},"1128":{"id":"/docs/user/everyday-use/use-incognito-7","page_id":"/docs/user/everyday-use/use-incognito","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/user/everyday-use/use-incognito#️-steps","content":"A box called \"What Incognito does\" appears the first time. Tap **Got it**."},"1129":{"id":"/docs/user/everyday-use/use-incognito-8","page_id":"/docs/user/everyday-use/use-incognito","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/user/everyday-use/use-incognito#️-steps","content":"Chat as usual."},"1130":{"id":"/docs/user/everyday-use/use-incognito-9","page_id":"/docs/user/everyday-use/use-incognito","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/user/everyday-use/use-incognito#️-steps","content":"To finish, open the profile menu and tap **Incognito** again. It shows **Off**."},"1131":{"id":"/docs/user/everyday-use/use-incognito-10","page_id":"/docs/user/everyday-use/use-incognito","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/user/everyday-use/use-incognito#️-what-it-does","content":"Incognito turns off memory and personalization across MaiPai. What you do while it is on stays out of your history. When you turn it off, those chats are forgotten."},"1132":{"id":"/docs/user/everyday-use/use-incognito-11","page_id":"/docs/user/everyday-use/use-incognito","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/user/everyday-use/use-incognito#️-what-it-does","content":"What is kept: nothing is saved to your history or memories. MaiPai holds the chat in the hub's working memory only, so it can follow the conversation while you talk. That copy is dropped when you turn Incognito off, after the chat has sat idle for two hours, or when the hub restarts. It does not keep a turn trace either."},"1133":{"id":"/docs/user/everyday-use/use-incognito-12","page_id":"/docs/user/everyday-use/use-incognito","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/user/everyday-use/use-incognito#️-what-it-does","content":"Incognito belongs to the tab you are in. A new tab starts with it off. While it is on, the **Projects** page sends you back to chat."},"1134":{"id":"/docs/user/everyday-use/use-incognito-13","page_id":"/docs/user/everyday-use/use-incognito","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/user/everyday-use/use-incognito#-who-can-use-it","content":"Incognito chats are for owners, admins and adults. Teens, children and guests do not get Incognito chats. The **Incognito** item may still show in their profile menu, but the hub refuses to start a private chat for them, so nothing is turned on for them."},"1135":{"id":"/docs/user/everyday-use/use-incognito-14","page_id":"/docs/user/everyday-use/use-incognito","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/user/everyday-use/use-incognito#-still-need-help","content":"If Incognito does not start a chat, check your role in What each role can do. Ask the person who runs the house to change it."},"1136":{"id":"/docs/user/fix-a-problem/a-setting-will-not-save","page_id":"/docs/user/fix-a-problem/a-setting-will-not-save","type":"page","content":"If a setting will not save","breadcrumbs":["Docs","User guide","🛟 Fix a problem"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/user/fix-a-problem/a-setting-will-not-save"},"1137":{"id":"/docs/user/fix-a-problem/a-setting-will-not-save-0","page_id":"/docs/user/fix-a-problem/a-setting-will-not-save","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/user/fix-a-problem/a-setting-will-not-save","content":"Why a setting snaps back or cannot be changed."},"1138":{"id":"/docs/user/fix-a-problem/a-setting-will-not-save-1","page_id":"/docs/user/fix-a-problem/a-setting-will-not-save","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/user/fix-a-problem/a-setting-will-not-save#-a-lock-means-an-admin-controls-this-one","content":"🔒 A lock means an admin controls this one"},"1139":{"id":"/docs/user/fix-a-problem/a-setting-will-not-save-2","page_id":"/docs/user/fix-a-problem/a-setting-will-not-save","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/user/fix-a-problem/a-setting-will-not-save#️-steps","content":"✍️ Steps"},"1140":{"id":"/docs/user/fix-a-problem/a-setting-will-not-save-3","page_id":"/docs/user/fix-a-problem/a-setting-will-not-save","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/user/fix-a-problem/a-setting-will-not-save#️-comfort-settings","content":"🎚️ Comfort settings"},"1141":{"id":"/docs/user/fix-a-problem/a-setting-will-not-save-4","page_id":"/docs/user/fix-a-problem/a-setting-will-not-save","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/user/fix-a-problem/a-setting-will-not-save#-still-need-help","content":"🙋 Still need help?"},"1142":{"id":"/docs/user/fix-a-problem/a-setting-will-not-save-5","page_id":"/docs/user/fix-a-problem/a-setting-will-not-save","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/user/fix-a-problem/a-setting-will-not-save#-a-lock-means-an-admin-controls-this-one","content":"A greyed-out or locked setting was set by an admin. You cannot change it. The row says who to ask."},"1143":{"id":"/docs/user/fix-a-problem/a-setting-will-not-save-6","page_id":"/docs/user/fix-a-problem/a-setting-will-not-save","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/user/fix-a-problem/a-setting-will-not-save#️-steps","content":"Look for a lock or a grey row next to the setting."},"1144":{"id":"/docs/user/fix-a-problem/a-setting-will-not-save-7","page_id":"/docs/user/fix-a-problem/a-setting-will-not-save","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/user/fix-a-problem/a-setting-will-not-save#️-steps","content":"If you see one, ask an admin to change it or unlock it for you."},"1145":{"id":"/docs/user/fix-a-problem/a-setting-will-not-save-8","page_id":"/docs/user/fix-a-problem/a-setting-will-not-save","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/user/fix-a-problem/a-setting-will-not-save#️-steps","content":"If there is no lock, reload the page and try again."},"1146":{"id":"/docs/user/fix-a-problem/a-setting-will-not-save-9","page_id":"/docs/user/fix-a-problem/a-setting-will-not-save","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/user/fix-a-problem/a-setting-will-not-save#️-steps","content":"Check that you are on the right page. Your own settings are under **Settings**."},"1147":{"id":"/docs/user/fix-a-problem/a-setting-will-not-save-10","page_id":"/docs/user/fix-a-problem/a-setting-will-not-save","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/user/fix-a-problem/a-setting-will-not-save#️-steps","content":"If it still snaps back, check for a message near the setting and follow it."},"1148":{"id":"/docs/user/fix-a-problem/a-setting-will-not-save-11","page_id":"/docs/user/fix-a-problem/a-setting-will-not-save","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/user/fix-a-problem/a-setting-will-not-save#️-comfort-settings","content":"For text size and motion, a row set to **Preset** follows your style. Pick a different **Comfort style** or change the single row. See Make it easier to read."},"1149":{"id":"/docs/user/fix-a-problem/a-setting-will-not-save-12","page_id":"/docs/user/fix-a-problem/a-setting-will-not-save","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/user/fix-a-problem/a-setting-will-not-save#-still-need-help","content":"Admins, see Settings reference. Others, see Still stuck."},"1150":{"id":"/docs/user/fix-a-problem/cannot-sign-in","page_id":"/docs/user/fix-a-problem/cannot-sign-in","type":"page","content":"If you cannot sign in","breadcrumbs":["Docs","User guide","🛟 Fix a problem"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/user/fix-a-problem/cannot-sign-in"},"1151":{"id":"/docs/user/fix-a-problem/cannot-sign-in-0","page_id":"/docs/user/fix-a-problem/cannot-sign-in","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/user/fix-a-problem/cannot-sign-in","content":"What to try when your PIN or password is refused."},"1152":{"id":"/docs/user/fix-a-problem/cannot-sign-in-1","page_id":"/docs/user/fix-a-problem/cannot-sign-in","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/user/fix-a-problem/cannot-sign-in#️-steps","content":"✍️ Steps"},"1153":{"id":"/docs/user/fix-a-problem/cannot-sign-in-2","page_id":"/docs/user/fix-a-problem/cannot-sign-in","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/user/fix-a-problem/cannot-sign-in#-a-brand-new-install","content":"🆕 A brand new install"},"1154":{"id":"/docs/user/fix-a-problem/cannot-sign-in-3","page_id":"/docs/user/fix-a-problem/cannot-sign-in","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/user/fix-a-problem/cannot-sign-in#-teens-children-and-guests","content":"🔐 Teens, children and guests"},"1155":{"id":"/docs/user/fix-a-problem/cannot-sign-in-4","page_id":"/docs/user/fix-a-problem/cannot-sign-in","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/user/fix-a-problem/cannot-sign-in#-still-need-help","content":"🙋 Still need help?"},"1156":{"id":"/docs/user/fix-a-problem/cannot-sign-in-5","page_id":"/docs/user/fix-a-problem/cannot-sign-in","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/user/fix-a-problem/cannot-sign-in#️-steps","content":"Make sure you picked your own name from the list."},"1