ways do."},"1164":{"id":"/docs/user/fix-a-problem/cannot-sign-in-13","page_id":"/docs/user/fix-a-problem/cannot-sign-in","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/user/fix-a-problem/cannot-sign-in#-still-need-help","content":"Admins, see First-run setup. Others, see Still stuck."},"1165":{"id":"/docs/user/fix-a-problem/chat-does-not-answer","page_id":"/docs/user/fix-a-problem/chat-does-not-answer","type":"page","content":"If chat does not answer","breadcrumbs":["Docs","User guide","🛟 Fix a problem"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/user/fix-a-problem/chat-does-not-answer"},"1166":{"id":"/docs/user/fix-a-problem/chat-does-not-answer-0","page_id":"/docs/user/fix-a-problem/chat-does-not-answer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/user/fix-a-problem/chat-does-not-answer","content":"What to try when you send a message and nothing comes back."},"1167":{"id":"/docs/user/fix-a-problem/chat-does-not-answer-1","page_id":"/docs/user/fix-a-problem/chat-does-not-answer","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/user/fix-a-problem/chat-does-not-answer#️-steps","content":"✍️ Steps"},"1168":{"id":"/docs/user/fix-a-problem/chat-does-not-answer-2","page_id":"/docs/user/fix-a-problem/chat-does-not-answer","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/user/fix-a-problem/chat-does-not-answer#-try-a-fresh-start","content":"🔁 Try a fresh start"},"1169":{"id":"/docs/user/fix-a-problem/chat-does-not-answer-3","page_id":"/docs/user/fix-a-problem/chat-does-not-answer","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/user/fix-a-problem/chat-does-not-answer#-still-need-help","content":"🙋 Still need help?"},"1170":{"id":"/docs/user/fix-a-problem/chat-does-not-answer-4","page_id":"/docs/user/fix-a-problem/chat-does-not-answer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/user/fix-a-problem/chat-does-not-answer#️-steps","content":"Wait a minute. The first answer after a restart can be slow, and you may see **Starting your AI…**."},"1171":{"id":"/docs/user/fix-a-problem/chat-does-not-answer-5","page_id":"/docs/user/fix-a-problem/chat-do