","url":"/docs/user/privacy-and-safety/forget-something#-erase-everything-about-a-child","content":"Owners and admins only:"},"1247":{"id":"/docs/user/privacy-and-safety/forget-something-15","page_id":"/docs/user/privacy-and-safety/forget-something","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/user/privacy-and-safety/forget-something#-erase-everything-about-a-child","content":"Open the child's profile and tap **Memories**."},"1248":{"id":"/docs/user/privacy-and-safety/forget-something-16","page_id":"/docs/user/privacy-and-safety/forget-something","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/user/privacy-and-safety/forget-something#-erase-everything-about-a-child","content":"Tap **Forget everything about** and the child's name."},"1249":{"id":"/docs/user/privacy-and-safety/forget-something-17","page_id":"/docs/user/privacy-and-safety/forget-something","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/user/privacy-and-safety/forget-something#-erase-everything-about-a-child","content":"Confirm with **Yes, forget everything**."},"1250":{"id":"/docs/user/privacy-and-safety/forget-something-18","page_id":"/docs/user/privacy-and-safety/forget-something","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/user/privacy-and-safety/forget-something#-erase-everything-about-a-child","content":"Before you erase, tap **Export** and the child's name first if you want a copy."},"1251":{"id":"/docs/user/privacy-and-safety/forget-something-19","page_id":"/docs/user/privacy-and-safety/forget-something","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/user/privacy-and-safety/forget-something#-teens-and-adults","content":"Only that person can forget their own memories. An admin cannot."},"1252":{"id":"/docs/user/privacy-and-safety/forget-something-20","page_id":"/docs/user/privacy-and-safety/forget-something","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/user/privacy-and-safety/forget-something#-still-need-help","content":"Ask the person who runs the house. Admins, see Backups and restore."},"1253":{"id":"/docs/user/privacy-and-safety/what-never-leave