ves#-still-need-help","content":"🙋 Still need help?"},"1261":{"id":"/docs/user/privacy-and-safety/what-never-leaves-7","page_id":"/docs/user/privacy-and-safety/what-never-leaves","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/user/privacy-and-safety/what-never-leaves","content":"These stay on your computer:"},"1262":{"id":"/docs/user/privacy-and-safety/what-never-leaves-8","page_id":"/docs/user/privacy-and-safety/what-never-leaves","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/user/privacy-and-safety/what-never-leaves","content":"Your conversations."},"1263":{"id":"/docs/user/privacy-and-safety/what-never-leaves-9","page_id":"/docs/user/privacy-and-safety/what-never-leaves","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/user/privacy-and-safety/what-never-leaves","content":"Everything MaiPai remembers."},"1264":{"id":"/docs/user/privacy-and-safety/what-never-leaves-10","page_id":"/docs/user/privacy-and-safety/what-never-leaves","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/user/privacy-and-safety/what-never-leaves","content":"Every profile in your household."},"1265":{"id":"/docs/user/privacy-and-safety/what-never-leaves-11","page_id":"/docs/user/privacy-and-safety/what-never-leaves","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/user/privacy-and-safety/what-never-leaves","content":"Anything your family says. It is never used to train anything."},"1266":{"id":"/docs/user/privacy-and-safety/what-never-leaves-12","page_id":"/docs/user/privacy-and-safety/what-never-leaves","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/user/privacy-and-safety/what-never-leaves#-what-maipai-does-not-collect","content":"No usage stats."},"1267":{"id":"/docs/user/privacy-and-safety/what-never-leaves-13","page_id":"/docs/user/privacy-and-safety/what-never-leaves","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/user/privacy-and-safety/what-never-leaves#-what-maipai-does-not-collect","content":"No crash reports."},"1268":{"id":"/docs/user/privacy-and-safety/what-never-leaves-14","page_id":"/docs/user/privacy-and-safety/what-never-leaves","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/user/privacy-and-safety/what-never-leaves#-your-browser","content":"Your browser saves MaiPai's own screens so the app can open without internet. It never stores what you typed or what MaiPai remembers."},"1269":{"id":"/docs/user/privacy-and-safety/what-never-leaves-15","page_id":"/docs/user/privacy-and-safety/what-never-leaves","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/user/privacy-and-safety/what-never-leaves#️-temporary-chats","content":"An owner, admin or adult can mark a chat as temporary. Its turns are not added to history or memory. If you open it again, the old turns do not return. This covers MaiPai on this computer only."},"1270":{"id":"/docs/user/privacy-and-safety/what-never-leaves-16","page_id":"/docs/user/privacy-and-safety/what-never-leaves","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/user/privacy-and-safety/what-never-leaves#-a-childs-hard-moment","content":"The adults get a note with the child's name only, never what was said. It cannot be turned off."},"1271":{"id":"/docs/user/privacy-and-safety/what-never-leaves-17","page_id":"/docs/user/privacy-and-safety/what-never-leaves","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/user/privacy-and-safety/what-never-leaves#️-check-it","content":"Tap **Privacy**."},"1272":{"id":"/docs/user/privacy-and-safety/what-never-leaves-18","page_id":"/docs/user/privacy-and-safety/what-never-leaves","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/user/privacy-and-safety/what-never-leaves#️-check-it","content":"Read **What leaves your house**. It names every exception."},"1273":{"id":"/docs/user/privacy-and-safety/what-never-leaves-19","page_id":"/docs/user/privacy-and-safety/what-never-leaves","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/user/privacy-and-safety/what-never-leaves#-still-need-help","content":"See What stays in the house, or ask the person who runs the house."},"1274":{"id":"/docs/user/privacy-and-safety/what-stays-in-the-house","page_id":"/docs/user/privacy-and-safety/what-stays-in-the-house","type":"page","content":"What stays in the house","breadcrumbs":["Docs","User guide","🔒 Privacy & safety"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/user/privacy-and-safety/what-stays-in-the-house"},"1275":{"id":"/docs/user/privacy-and-safety/what-stays-in-the-house-0","page_id":"/docs/user/privacy-and-safety/what-stays-in-the-house","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/user/privacy-and-safety/what-stays-in-the-house","content":"Your chats, memories and profiles stay on your own computer."},"1276":{"id":"/docs/user/privacy-and-safety/what-stays-in-the-house-1","page_id":"/docs/user/privacy-and-safety/what-stays-in-the-house","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/user/privacy-and-safety/what-stays-in-the-house#️-see-for-yourself","content":"✍️ See for yourself"},"1277":{"id":"/docs/user/privacy-and-safety/what-stays-in-the-house-2","page_id":"/docs/user/privacy-and-safety/what-stays-in-the-house","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/user/privacy-and-safety/what-stays-in-the-house#-what-can-leave","content":"📨 What can leave"},"1278":{"id":"/docs/user/privacy-and-safety/what-stays-in-the-house-3","page_id":"/docs/user/privacy-and-safety/what-stays-in-the-house","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/user/privacy-and-safety/what-stays-in-the-house#️-temporary-chats","content":"🕶️ Temporary chats"},"1279":{"id":"/docs/user/privacy-and-safety/what-stays-in-the-house-4","page_id":"/docs/user/privacy-and-safety/what-stays-in-the-house","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/user/privacy-and-safety/what-stays-in-the-house#-still-need-help","content":"🙋 Still need help?"},"1280":{"id":"/docs/user/privacy-and-safety/what-stays-in-the-house-5","page_id":"/docs/user/privacy-and-safety/what-stays-in-the-house","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/user/privacy-and-safety/what-stays-in-the-house","content":"Your conversations, memories and family profiles stay on the computer in your house. MaiPai does not run a server that your family's information passes through. Nothing reports back about how you use it."},"1281":{"id":"/docs/user/privacy-and-safety/what-stays-in-the-house-6","page_id":"/docs/user/privacy-and-safety/what-stays-in-the-house","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/user/privacy-and-safety/what-stays-in-the-house#️-see-for-yourself","content":"Tap **Privacy** in the main menu."},"1282":{"id":"/docs/user/privacy-and-safety/what-stays-in-the-house-7","page_id":"/docs/user/privacy-and-safety/what-stays-in-the-house","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/user/privacy-and-safety/what-stays-in-the-house#️-see-for-yourself","content":"Read the answers to \"Can someone outside see what we say to MaiPai?\" and \"Can someone reach into your house?\""},"1283":{"id":"/docs/user/privacy-and-safety/what-stays-in-the-house-8","page_id":"/docs/user/privacy-and-safety/what-stays-in-the-house","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/user/privacy-and-safety/what-stays-in-the-house#️-see-for-yourself","content":"Open **What leaves your house** to see every connection."},"1284":{"id":"/docs/user/privacy-and-safety/what-stays-in-the-house-9","page_id":"/docs/user/privacy-and-safety/what-stays-in-the-house","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/user/privacy-and-safety/what-stays-in-the-house#️-see-for-yourself","content":"For each connection you see **When** it happens, **What it sends**, **Who gets it** and **How long they keep it**. Anything not listed does not happen."},"1285":{"id":"/docs/user/privacy-and-safety/what-stays-in-the-house-10","page_id":"/docs/user/privacy-and-safety/what-stays-in-the-house","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/user/privacy-and-safety/what-stays-in-the-house#-what-can-leave","content":"A feature can send the small piece it needs, such as your search words or the place for a weather check. A web search sends the words you searched, never your name or address. A child's or teen's search never goes to DuckDuckGo or Brave, and it follows the household **Search sources** choice."},"1286":{"id":"/docs/user/privacy-and-safety/what-stays-in-the-house-11","page_id":"/docs/user/privacy-and-safety/what-stays-in-the-house","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/user/privacy-and-safety/what-stays-in-the-house#️-temporary-chats","content":"An owner, admin or adult can mark a chat as temporary. It is not saved to history or memory."},"1287":{"id":"/docs/user/privacy-and-safety/what-stays-in-the-house-12","page_id":"/docs/user/privacy-and-safety/what-stays-in-the-house","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/user/privacy-and-safety/what-stays-in-the-house#-still-need-help","content":"Not sure why a connection is listed? Ask the person who runs the house. Admins, see Privacy audit."},"1288":{"id":"/docs/user/start-here/find-your-way-around","page_id":"/docs/user/start-here/find-your-way-around","type":"page","content":"Find your way around","breadcrumbs":["Docs","User guide","🚀 Start here"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/user/start-here/find-your-way-around"},"1289":{"id":"/docs/user/start-here/find-your-way-around-0","page_id":"/docs/user/start-here/find-your-way-around","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/user/start-here/find-your-way-around","content":"What each item in the main menu does."},"1290":{"id":"/docs/user/start-here/find-your-way-around-1","page_id":"/docs/user/start-here/find-your-way-around","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/user/start-here/find-your-way-around#-the-main-menu","content":"🧭 The main menu"},"1291":{"id":"/docs/user/start-here/find-your-way-around-2","page_id":"/docs/user/start-here/find-your-way-around","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/user/start-here/find-your-way-around#-the-bell","content":"🔔 The bell"},"1292":{"id":"/docs/user/start-here/find-your-way-around-3","page_id":"/docs/user/start-here/find-your-way-around","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/user/start-here/find-your-way-around#️-steps-to-try-it","content":"✍️ Steps to try it"},"1293":{"id":"/docs/user/start-here/find-your-way-around-4","page_id":"/docs/user/start-here/find-your-way-around","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/user/start-here/find-your-way-around#-still-need-help","content":"🙋 Still need help?"},"1294":{"id":"/docs/user/start-here/find-your-way-around-5","page_id":"/docs/user/start-here/find-your-way-around","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/user/start-here/find-your-way-around","content":"The main menu runs down the left side on a computer. On a phone it stays as the same thin column of icons. It always has the same items."},"1295":{"id":"/docs/user/start-here/find-your-way-around-6","page_id":"/docs/user/start-here/find-your-way-around","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/user/start-here/find-your-way-around#-the-main-menu","content":"**Home**: counts for people, updates and repairs, and recent activity."},"1296":{"id":"/docs/user/start-here/find-your-way-around-7","page_id":"/docs/user/start-here/find-your-way-around","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/user/start-here/find-your-way-around#-the-main-menu","content":"**Chat**: talk to MaiPai. Your past chats are listed here too."},"1297":{"id":"/docs/user/start-here/find-your-way-around-8","page_id":"/docs/user/start-here/find-your-way-around","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/user/start-here/find-your-way-around#-the-main-menu","content":"**Library**: the files you and the family have added."},"1298":{"id":"/docs/user/start-here/find-your-way-around-9","page_id":"/docs/user/start-here/find-your-way-around","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/user/start-here/find-your-way-around#-the-main-menu","content":"**Family**: one card for each person. Tap a card to open that person's profile, where memories live."},"1299":{"id":"/docs/user/start-here/find-your-way-around-10","page_id":"/docs/user/start-here/find-your-way-around","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/user/start-here/find-your-way-around#-the-main-menu","content":"Your own picture or initial sits at the bottom of the menu. Tap it to open your profile menu. It holds **Notifications**, **Incognito**, **Settings** and **Help**, and the way to sign out. Adults also see household settings under **Settings**. To see what stays in the house, read What stays in the house."},"1300":{"id":"/docs/user/start-here/find-your-way-around-11","page_id":"/docs/user/start-here/find-your-way-around","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/user/start-here/find-your-way-around#-the-main-menu","content":"The search box at the top finds chats, people and pages."},"1301":{"id":"/docs/user/start-here/find-your-way-around-12","page_id":"/docs/user/start-here/find-your-way-around","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/user/start-here/find-your-way-around#-the-bell","content":"The bell shows new notices. See See your notifications."},"1302":{"id":"/docs/user/start-here/find-your-way-around-13","page_id":"/docs/user/start-here/find-your-way-around","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/user/start-here/find-your-way-around#️-steps-to-try-it","content":"Tap **Chat** and start a new chat."},"1303":{"id":"/docs/user/start-here/find-your-way-around-14","page_id":"/docs/user/start-here/find-your-way-around","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/user/start-here/find-your-way-around#️-steps-to-try-it","content":"Tap **Family** and tap your own card."},"1304":{"id":"/docs/user/start-here/find-your-way-around-15","page_id":"/docs/user/start-here/find-your-way-around","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/user/start-here/find-your-way-around#️-steps-to-try-it","content":"Tap **Memories** to see what MaiPai remembers about you."},"1305":{"id":"/docs/user/start-here/find-your-way-around-16","page_id":"/docs/user/start-here/find-your-way-around","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/user/start-here/find-your-way-around#️-steps-to-try-it","content":"Tap **Settings** to see what you can change."},"1306":{"id":"/docs/user/start-here/find-your-way-around-17","page_id":"/docs/user/start-here/find-your-way-around","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/user/start-here/find-your-way-around#️-steps-to-try-it","content":"<Callout type=\"info\">Some settings show a lock. A lock means an admin controls that one.</Callout>"},"1307":{"id":"/docs/user/start-here/find-your-way-around-18","page_id":"/docs/user/start-here/find-your-way-around","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/user/start-here/find-your-way-around#-still-need-help","content":"If a page will not open, see If a page will not load."},"1308":{"id":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall","page_id":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall","type":"page","content":"Install, upgrade, uninstall and fix the install","breadcrumbs":["Docs","User guide","🚀 Start here"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall"},"1309":{"id":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall-0","page_id":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall","content":"Put MaiPai Home on a Mac, update it, go back a version, remove it, and fix the common install problems."},"1310":{"id":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall-1","page_id":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall#before-you-start","content":"Before you start"},"1311":{"id":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall-2","page_id":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall#install","content":"Install"},"1312":{"id":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall-3","page_id":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall#the-ai-engine-installs-from-the-wizard","content":"The AI engine installs from the wizard"},"1313":{"id":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall-4","page_id":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall#what-happens-after-a-restart","content":"What happens after a restart"},"1314":{"id":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall-5","page_id":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall#tune-the-mac","content":"Tune the Mac"},"1315":{"id":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall-6","page_id":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall#upgrade","content":"Upgrade"},"1316":{"id":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall-7","page_id":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall#go-back-one-version","content":"Go back one version"},"1317":{"id":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall-8","page_id":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall#uninstall","content":"Uninstall"},"1318":{"id":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall-9","page_id":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall#where-the-logs-are","content":"Where the logs are"},"1319":{"id":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall-10","page_id":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall#change-a-port","content":"Change a port"},"1320":{"id":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall-11","page_id":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall#fix-a-problem","content":"Fix a problem"},"1321":{"id":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall-12","page_id":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall#before-you-start","content":"Use the Mac itself. You need three things:"},"1322":{"id":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall-13","page_id":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall#before-you-start","content":"A Mac with Apple silicon or Intel, and an internet connection."},"1323":{"id":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall-14","page_id":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall#before-you-start","content":"3 GB of free disk space for Home. The installer checks this first."},"1324":{"id":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall-15","page_id":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall#before-you-start","content":"An account that can use `sudo` (an administrator)."},"1325":{"id":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall-16","page_id":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall#before-you-start","content":"The AI engine is a separate step that Home does for you later, inside the setup wizard, and only if this computer runs the AI. It needs 6 GB more to build, plus room for the AI models."},"1326":{"id":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall-17","page_id":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall#before-you-start","content":"| Plan        | Free space needed for the models |\n| ----------- | -------------------------------- |\n| Recommended | 26 GB                            |","table":"table-0"},"1327":{"id":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall-18","page_id":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall#before-you-start","content":"| Plan     | Free space needed for the models |\n| -------- | -------------------------------- |\n| Moderate | 19 GB                            |","table":"table-0"},"1328":{"id":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall-19","page_id":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall#before-you-start","content":"| Plan    | Free space needed for the models |\n| ------- | -------------------------------- |\n| Minimal | 14 GB                            |","table":"table-0"},"1329":{"id":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall-20","page_id":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall#before-you-start","content":"You do not need Homebrew. You do not need to install anything else first."},"1330":{"id":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall-21","page_id":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall#install","content":"Open Terminal on the Mac and paste this one line. A plain SSH connection works too."},"1331":{"id":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall-22","page_id":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall#install","content":"This installs Home only, so it takes about a minute. When Home answers, the installer prints the address to open, such as `http://localhost:3000`. Open it in a browser to start the setup wizard."},"1332":{"id":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall-23","page_id":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall#install","content":"If it stops, read the last lines. They say what went wrong and what to do. Fix that, then run the same line again. It picks up where it stopped and does not hurt anything already installed."},"1333":{"id":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall-24","page_id":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall#the-ai-engine-installs-from-the-wizard","content":"The wizard asks where the AI runs."},"1334":{"id":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall-25","page_id":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall#the-ai-engine-installs-from-the-wizard","content":"**This computer.** Home starts the AI engine install right away. A progress bar at the bottom of the wizard shows each step: fetch, build and start, then the model downloads. You can keep answering questions while it works."},"1335":{"id":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall-26","page_id":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall#the-ai-engine-installs-from-the-wizard","content":"**Another computer.** Nothing is installed on this one. You pair the other computer later."},"1336":{"id":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall-27","page_id":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall#the-ai-engine-installs-from-the-wizard","content":"The engine needs the Mac's logged-in desktop to use the graphics chip. If nobody is logged in at the Mac, the bar stops and says so. Log in at the Mac and press Try again."},"1337":{"id":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall-28","page_id":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall#the-ai-engine-installs-from-the-wizard","content":"If the bar stops for any reason, it says what went wrong. Fix that and press Try again. It picks up where it stopped. You can also run the engine step by hand."},"1338":{"id":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall-29","page_id":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall#what-happens-after-a-restart","content":"MaiPai Home starts by itself when the Mac starts. No one needs to log in."},"1339":{"id":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall-30","page_id":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall#what-happens-after-a-restart","content":"The AI engine starts when the Mac's user logs in. To make that automatic, turn on automatic login: open System Settings, then Users and Groups, then Automatic login. macOS only allows automatic login when FileVault is off. For a Mac that must come back by itself after a power cut, turn FileVault off. The trade: anyone who can touch the Mac can read its disk, so keep it somewhere safe. If you keep FileVault on, log in once at the Mac after a restart and the engine starts."},"1340":{"id":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall-31","page_id":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall#tune-the-mac","content":"A Mac that runs Home all day works best with a few settings changed. Setup shows them as a list. You can also run the tool yourself at the Mac. It changes nothing unless you add `--yes`."},"1341":{"id":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall-32","page_id":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall#tune-the-mac","content":"Two kinds of change are in the list."},"1342":{"id":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall-33","page_id":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall#tune-the-mac","content":"Changes inside Home's own folders. Home makes them for you. They keep Spotlight out of Home's files and keep the big AI models out of Time Machine. Home's data stays in your backups."},"1343":{"id":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall-34","page_id":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall#tune-the-mac","content":"Changes to the whole Mac. These need an administrator, so Home asks first. If Home cannot do one, it shows the exact line to paste in Terminal at the Mac. They stop the Mac from sleeping, turn it back on after a power cut, stop big macOS upgrades by themselves (security updates stay on), and turn on SSH. One more lets the graphics chip use more memory. You only need that one for very big AI models later."},"1344":{"id":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall-35","page_id":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall#tune-the-mac","content":"Every change can be undone. Run the same line with `revert` and the name of the item."},"1345":{"id":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall-36","page_id":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall#tune-the-mac","content":"Some things only you can do, so the list shows them as advice: leave iCloud, Siri and Apple Intelligence off for this account, turn the screen saver off, give the Mac a fixed address in your router, approve it in Tailscale, and install nothing extra except the Command Line Tools."},"1346":{"id":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall-37","page_id":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall#upgrade","content":"Run the same install line again. If the AI engine is already installed, it is rebuilt too, so the Mac must have someone logged in. It does these steps in order:"},"1347":{"id":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall-38","page_id":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall#upgrade","content":"Stops MaiPai Home and the engine."},"1348":{"id":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall-39","page_id":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall#upgrade","content":"Saves a copy of your data in `/usr/local/maipai-home/upgrade-backups`. It keeps the last two copies."},"1349":{"id":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall-40","page_id":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall#upgrade","content":"Replaces the program files. Your data, backups and engine models stay where they are."},"1350":{"id":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall-41","page_id":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall#upgrade","content":"Starts everything again and waits until it answers."},"1351":{"id":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall-42","page_id":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall#upgrade","content":"Home keeps the same address it had before."},"1352":{"id":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall-43","page_id":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall#upgrade","content":"To install one exact version, add `--version` and the release name."},"1353":{"id":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall-44","page_id":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall#go-back-one-version","content":"If an upgrade does not work for you, go back."},"1354":{"id":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall-45","page_id":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall#go-back-one-version","content":"This installs the version you had before. It also puts back the data copy from just before the upgrade. Your newer data is not thrown away. It is moved to a folder named `data.rolled-back-` and the date, next to the install."},"1355":{"id":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall-46","page_id":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall#uninstall","content":"This stops and removes the services. Your data is kept unless you type `DELETE MY DATA` exactly when it asks. Any other answer keeps everything. Make a backup first if you are not sure."},"1356":{"id":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall-47","page_id":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall#where-the-logs-are","content":"| What        | Where                               |\n| ----------- | ----------------------------------- |\n| MaiPai Home | `/usr/local/maipai-home/data/logs/` |","table":"table-1"},"1357":{"id":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall-48","page_id":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall#where-the-logs-are","content":"| What          | Where                                     |\n| ------------- | ----------------------------------------- |\n| The AI engine | `/usr/local/maipai-home/stack/data/logs/` |","table":"table-1"},"1358":{"id":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall-49","page_id":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall#where-the-logs-are","content":"A daily job keeps each log file under about 20 MB. It keeps the last three older copies."},"1359":{"id":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall-50","page_id":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall#change-a-port","content":"Home uses port 3000 and the engine uses port 8770. If something else already uses one, the installer picks the next free number. To choose your own, set it before the install line."},"1360":{"id":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall-51","page_id":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall#fix-a-problem","content":"| What you see                                       | What to do                                             |\n| -------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------ |\n| The wizard bar says nobody is logged in at the Mac | Log in at the Mac, then press Try again in the wizard. |","table":"table-2"},"1361":{"id":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall-52","page_id":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall#fix-a-problem","content":"| What you see                                      | What to do                                                                 |\n| ------------------------------------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| The wizard bar says the AI engine install stopped | Read the plain words on the bar, fix what they name, then press Try again. |","table":"table-2"},"1362":{"id":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall-53","page_id":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall#fix-a-problem","content":"| What you see              | What to do                                                                                     |\n| ------------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| \"these tools are missing\" | In Terminal run `xcode-select --install`, wait until it ends, then run the install line again. |","table":"table-2"},"1363":{"id":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall-54","page_id":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall#fix-a-problem","content":"| What you see                 | What to do                                                                        |\n| ---------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| \"not enough free disk space\" | Free up space, then run the install line again, or press Try again in the wizard. |","table":"table-2"},"1364":{"id":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall-55","page_id":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall#fix-a-problem","content":"| What you see         | What to do                                                            |\n| -------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| \"could not download\" | Check the Mac's internet connection, then run the install line again. |","table":"table-2"},"1365":{"id":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall-56","page_id":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall#fix-a-problem","content":"| What you see                          | What to do                                                                                                 |\n| ------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| macOS says it cannot verify a program | Open System Settings, then Privacy and Security, and choose Allow Anyway. Then run the install line again. |","table":"table-2"},"1366":{"id":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall-57","page_id":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall#fix-a-problem","content":"| What you see         | What to do                                                                                                                      |\n| -------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| Home did not come up | Read the last lines of `/usr/local/maipai-home/data/logs/launchd.err.log`. Fix what they name, then run the install line again. |","table":"table-2"},"1367":{"id":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall-58","page_id":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall#fix-a-problem","content":"| What you see                               | What to do                                     |\n| ------------------------------------------ | ---------------------------------------------- |\n| The engine does not answer after a restart | Log in at the Mac. The engine starts at login. |","table":"table-2"},"1368":{"id":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall-59","page_id":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/user/start-here/install-upgrade-uninstall#fix-a-problem","content":"If a run stops after it changed files, the last message tells you your data is safe. It also gives the rollback line."},"1369":{"id":"/docs/user/start-here/what-maipai-home-is","page_id":"/docs/user/start-here/what-maipai-home-is","type":"page","content":"What MaiPai Home is","breadcrumbs":["Docs","User guide","🚀 Start here"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/user/start-here/what-maipai-home-is"},"1370":{"id":"/docs/user/start-here/what-maipai-home-is-0","page_id":"/docs/user/start-here/what-maipai-home-is","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/user/start-here/what-maipai-home-is","content":"A private AI helper that lives on a computer in your house."},"1371":{"id":"/docs/user/start-here/what-maipai-home-is-1","page_id":"/docs/user/start-here/what-maipai-home-is","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/user/start-here/what-maipai-home-is#-what-you-can-do","content":"🏠 What you can do"},"1372":{"id":"/docs/user/start-here/what-maipai-home-is-2","page_id":"/docs/user/start-here/what-maipai-home-is","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/user/start-here/what-maipai-home-is#-who-uses-it","content":"👨‍👩‍👧 Who uses it"},"1373":{"id":"/docs/user/start-here/what-maipai-home-is-3","page_id":"/docs/user/start-here/what-maipai-home-is","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/user/start-here/what-maipai-home-is#-what-stays-private","content":"🔒 What stays private"},"1374":{"id":"/docs/user/start-here/what-maipai-home-is-4","page_id":"/docs/user/start-here/what-maipai-home-is","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/user/start-here/what-maipai-home-is#-where-to-go-next","content":"🧭 Where to go next"},"1375":{"id":"/docs/user/start-here/what-maipai-home-is-5","page_id":"/docs/user/start-here/what-maipai-home-is","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/user/start-here/what-maipai-home-is#-still-need-help","content":"🙋 Still need help?"},"1376":{"id":"/docs/user/start-here/what-maipai-home-is-6","page_id":"/docs/user/start-here/what-maipai-home-is","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/user/start-here/what-maipai-home-is","content":"MaiPai Home is an AI helper for your family. It runs on a computer in your house, so your chats, memories and family details stay there."},"1377":{"id":"/docs/user/start-here/what-maipai-home-is-7","page_id":"/docs/user/start-here/what-maipai-home-is","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/user/start-here/what-maipai-home-is#-what-you-can-do","content":"Ask questions and get answers in a chat."},"1378":{"id":"/docs/user/start-here/what-maipai-home-is-8","page_id":"/docs/user/start-here/what-maipai-home-is","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/user/start-here/what-maipai-home-is#-what-you-can-do","content":"Talk to it out loud instead of typing."},"1379":{"id":"/docs/user/start-here/what-maipai-home-is-9","page_id":"/docs/user/start-here/what-maipai-home-is","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/user/start-here/what-maipai-home-is#-what-you-can-do","content":"Ask it to look something up and see where the answer came from."},"1380":{"id":"/docs/user/start-here/what-maipai-home-is-10","page_id":"/docs/user/start-here/what-maipai-home-is","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/user/start-here/what-maipai-home-is#-what-you-can-do","content":"Let it remember things that help you, and see or erase them any time."},"1381":{"id":"/docs/user/start-here/what-maipai-home-is-11","page_id":"/docs/user/start-here/what-maipai-home-is","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/user/start-here/what-maipai-home-is#-who-uses-it","content":"Everyone in the house gets their own profile. A grown-up runs the house and decides what children can see. Teens and adults keep their own chats private."},"1382":{"id":"/docs/user/start-here/what-maipai-home-is-12","page_id":"/docs/user/start-here/what-maipai-home-is","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/user/start-here/what-maipai-home-is#-what-stays-private","content":"Your chats and memories are not sent to MaiPai or anyone else. A few features, like a web search, send only the small piece they need. The Privacy page lists each one. See What stays in the house."},"1383":{"id":"/docs/user/start-here/what-maipai-home-is-13","page_id":"/docs/user/start-here/what-maipai-home-is","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/user/start-here/what-maipai-home-is#-where-to-go-next","content":"Read Your first minutes to sign in and send a message."},"1384":{"id":"/docs/user/start-here/what-maipai-home-is-14","page_id":"/docs/user/start-here/what-maipai-home-is","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/user/start-here/what-maipai-home-is#-where-to-go-next","content":"Read Find your way around to learn the main menu."},"1385":{"id":"/docs/user/start-here/what-maipai-home-is-15","page_id":"/docs/user/start-here/what-maipai-home-is","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/user/start-here/what-maipai-home-is#-still-need-help","content":"Ask the person who runs the house, or see If chat does not answer."},"1386":{"id":"/docs/user/start-here/your-first-minutes","page_id":"/docs/user/start-here/your-first-minutes","type":"page","content":"Your first minutes","breadcrumbs":["Docs","User guide","🚀 Start here"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/user/start-here/your-first-minutes"},"1387":{"id":"/docs/user/start-here/your-first-minutes-0","page_id":"/docs/user/start-here/your-first-minutes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/user/start-here/your-first-minutes","content":"Sign in for the first time and send your first message."},"1388":{"id":"/docs/user/start-here/your-first-minutes-1","page_id":"/docs/user/start-here/your-first-minutes","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/user/start-here/your-first-minutes#️-steps","content":"✍️ Steps"},"1389":{"id":"/docs/user/start-here/your-first-minutes-2","page_id":"/docs/user/start-here/your-first-minutes","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/user/start-here/your-first-minutes#-if-the-first-answer-takes-a-while","content":"🤔 If the first answer takes a while"},"1390":{"id":"/docs/user/start-here/your-first-minutes-3","page_id":"/docs/user/start-here/your-first-minutes","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/user/start-here/your-first-minutes#-still-need-help","content":"🙋 Still need help?"},"1391":{"id":"/docs/user/start-here/your-first-minutes-4","page_id":"/docs/user/start-here/your-first-minutes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/user/start-here/your-first-minutes#️-steps","content":"Open MaiPai Home in your web browser. Ask the person who runs the house for the address if you do not have it."},"1392":{"id":"/docs/user/start-here/your-first-minutes-5","page_id":"/docs/user/start-here/your-first-minutes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/user/start-here/your-first-minutes#️-steps","content":"Pick your name from the list of people."},"1393":{"id":"/docs/user/start-here/your-first-minutes-6","page_id":"/docs/user/start-here/your-first-minutes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/user/start-here/your-first-minutes#️-steps","content":"Under **Enter your PIN**, type your 4 digits. If you use a longer password, tap **Use a password instead**, type it in **Password**, then tap **Sign in**."},"1394":{"id":"/docs/user/start-here/your-first-minutes-7","page_id":"/docs/user/start-here/your-first-minutes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/user/start-here/your-first-minutes#️-steps","content":"Tap **Chat** in the main menu."},"1395":{"id":"/docs/user/start-here/your-first-minutes-8","page_id":"/docs/user/start-here/your-first-minutes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/user/start-here/your-first-minutes#️-steps","content":"Tap **New chat** if the page is not already empty."},"1396":{"id":"/docs/user/start-here/your-first-minutes-9","page_id":"/docs/user/start-here/your-first-minutes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/user/start-here/your-first-minutes#️-steps","content":"Click the box that says **Send a message...** and type a question."},"1397":{"id":"/docs/user/start-here/your-first-minutes-10","page_id":"/docs/user/start-here/your-first-minutes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/user/start-here/your-first-minutes#️-steps","content":"Press Enter, or tap the arrow button. The answer appears below your question."},"1398":{"id":"/docs/user/start-here/your-first-minutes-11","page_id":"/docs/user/start-here/your-first-minutes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/user/start-here/your-first-minutes#️-steps","content":"<Callout type=\"info\">Teens, children and guests may not need a PIN. Adults always do.</Callout>"},"1399":{"id":"/docs/user/start-here/your-first-minutes-12","page_id":"/docs/user/start-here/your-first-minutes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/user/start-here/your-first-minutes#-if-the-first-answer-takes-a-while","content":"The first reply can be slow while MaiPai gets ready. You may see **Starting your AI…**. Wait a minute and it will answer."},"1400":{"id":"/docs/user/start-here/your-first-minutes-13","page_id":"/docs/user/start-here/your-first-minutes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/user/start-here/your-first-minutes#-still-need-help","content":"If your PIN is refused, see If you cannot sign in. If the first chat stays silent, see If chat does not answer."},"1401":{"id":"/docs/user/your-family/check-in-on-a-child","page_id":"/docs/user/your-family/check-in-on-a-child","type":"page","content":"Check in on a child","breadcrumbs":["Docs","User guide","👨‍👩‍👧 Your family"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/user/your-family/check-in-on-a-child"},"1402":{"id":"/docs/user/your-family/check-in-on-a-child-0","page_id":"/docs/user/your-family/check-in-on-a-child","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/user/your-family/check-in-on-a-child","content":"What an owner or admin can see about a child, and what stays private."},"1403":{"id":"/docs/user/your-family/check-in-on-a-child-1","page_id":"/docs/user/your-family/check-in-on-a-child","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/user/your-family/check-in-on-a-child#️-steps","content":"✍️ Steps"},"1404":{"id":"/docs/user/your-family/check-in-on-a-child-2","page_id":"/docs/user/your-family/check-in-on-a-child","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/user/your-family/check-in-on-a-child#-when-a-child-has-a-hard-moment","content":"💛 When a child has a hard moment"},"1405":{"id":"/docs/user/your-family/check-in-on-a-child-3","page_id":"/docs/user/your-family/check-in-on-a-child","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/user/your-family/check-in-on-a-child#-teens-are-different","content":"🔐 Teens are different"},"1406":{"id":"/docs/user/your-family/check-in-on-a-child-4","page_id":"/docs/user/your-family/check-in-on-a-child","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/user/your-family/check-in-on-a-child#-still-need-help","content":"🙋 Still need help?"},"1407":{"id":"/docs/user/your-family/check-in-on-a-child-5","page_id":"/docs/user/your-family/check-in-on-a-child","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/user/your-family/check-in-on-a-child","content":"This page is for owners and admins."},"1408":{"id":"/docs/user/your-family/check-in-on-a-child-6","page_id":"/docs/user/your-family/check-in-on-a-child","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/user/your-family/check-in-on-a-child#️-steps","content":"Tap **Family**, then the child's card. Their **Profile** opens."},"1409":{"id":"/docs/user/your-family/check-in-on-a-child-7","page_id":"/docs/user/your-family/check-in-on-a-child","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/user/your-family/check-in-on-a-child#️-steps","content":"On **Overview** you see shared files and the child's details."},"1410":{"id":"/docs/user/your-family/check-in-on-a-child-8","page_id":"/docs/user/your-family/check-in-on-a-child","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/user/your-family/check-in-on-a-child#️-steps","content":"Tap **Memories** to see what MaiPai remembers about them."},"1411":{"id":"/docs/user/your-family/check-in-on-a-child-9","page_id":"/docs/user/your-family/check-in-on-a-child","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/user/your-family/check-in-on-a-child#️-steps","content":"Tap **Limits** to set daily time limits and storage. The time limits are saved but not applied yet."},"1412":{"id":"/docs/user/your-family/check-in-on-a-child-10","page_id":"/docs/user/your-family/check-in-on-a-child","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/user/your-family/check-in-on-a-child#️-steps","content":"Tap **Topics** to choose how MaiPai answers them about sensitive subjects."},"1413":{"id":"/docs/user/your-family/check-in-on-a-child-11","page_id":"/docs/user/your-family/check-in-on-a-child","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/user/your-family/check-in-on-a-child#️-steps","content":"Only owners and admins see **Limits** and **Topics**."},"1414":{"id":"/docs/user/your-family/check-in-on-a-child-12","page_id":"/docs/user/your-family/check-in-on-a-child","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/user/your-family/check-in-on-a-child#-when-a-child-has-a-hard-moment","content":"If a conversation seems to weigh on a child, every adult gets a notice: \"A check-in may help.\" It names the child but never says what was said. It cannot be turned off. Talk to the child, kindly and in person."},"1415":{"id":"/docs/user/your-family/check-in-on-a-child-13","page_id":"/docs/user/your-family/check-in-on-a-child","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/user/your-family/check-in-on-a-child#-teens-are-different","content":"A teen's profile, memories and settings are private. A parent gets no check-in view of a teen."},"1416":{"id":"/docs/user/your-family/check-in-on-a-child-14","page_id":"/docs/user/your-family/check-in-on-a-child","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/user/your-family/check-in-on-a-child#-still-need-help","content":"Admins, see Add people and parental controls. For anything else, see Still stuck."},"1417":{"id":"/docs/user/your-family/sensitive-subjects","page_id":"/docs/user/your-family/sensitive-subjects","type":"page","content":"Sensitive subjects","breadcrumbs":["Docs","User guide","👨‍👩‍👧 Your family"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/user/your-family/sensitive-subjects"},"1418":{"id":"/docs/user/your-family/sensitive-subjects-0","page_id":"/docs/user/your-family/sensitive-subjects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/user/your-family/sensitive-subjects","content":"Choose how MaiPai talks to a child about hard topics."},"1419":{"id":"/docs/user/your-family/sensitive-subjects-1","page_id":"/docs/user/your-family/sensitive-subjects","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/do