r updates one | A download request |"],[664,"| Row                   | When               | What goes             |\n| --------------------- | ------------------ | --------------------- |\n| Update check (GitHub) | At most once a day | Your internet address |"],[679,"| Row             | Destination                                                                                          |\n| --------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| Engine computer | Your engine computer, when someone chats or asks for a picture. Through Tailscale when you are away. |"],[676,"| Row            | Destination                         |\n| -------------- | ----------------------------------- |\n| Home Assistant | Your own Home Assistant on your LAN |"],[666,"| Row            | When          | What goes                                                                                                 |\n| -------------- | ------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| Internet check | Once a minute | A DNS lookup of example.com and an empty connection to 1.1.1.1:443. Turn it off under **Internet check**. |"],[667,"| Row        | When                                                  | What goes                         |\n| ---------- | ----------------------------------------------------- | --------------------------------- |\n| News feeds | About every 30 minutes at most, while the shelf is on | A plain request for the feed file |"],[670,"| Row        | When                                   | What goes              |\n| ---------- | -------------------------------------- | ---------------------- |\n| Voice list | When an adult opens the list of voices | A request for the list |"],[671,"| Row        | When                             | What goes        |\n| ---------- | -------------------------------- | ---------------- |\n| DuckDuc