te |\n| ---------------------- | -------------------------------------------- | ----- |\n| **Your Home is ready** | Save your backup key, then **Open my Home**. | Built |"],[275,"| Screen         | What it does     | State     |\n| -------------- | ---------------- | --------- |\n| First greeting | Home says hello. | Not built |"],[270,"| Screen       | What it does       | State                  |\n| ------------ | ------------------ | ---------------------- |\n| Setup checks | Test the computer. | Not built. It says so. |"],[269,"| Screen  | What it does                           | State                                                      |\n| ------- | -------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------- |\n| Storage | Choose where the AI models are stored. | Not built. The wizard says a disk picker is not available. |"],[267,"| Screen  | What it does              | State |\n| ------- | ------------------------- | ----- |\n| Welcome | Press **Set up my Home**. | Built |"],[271,"| Screen | What it does                        | State                                                         |\n| ------ | ----------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| Plan   | Recommend models for your hardware. | Not built. The plan from the installer is recorded for later. |"],[516,"| Setting                                                                         | Key                                          | Default | Level | What it does |\n| ------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | -------------------------------------------- | ------- | ----- | ------------ |\n| **Telegram me when I have trouble remembering something from our conversation** | `notifications.memory.judge_failed.telegram` | off     | basic |              |"],[510,"| Setting                                                                         | Key                  