 Level | What it does |\n| ------------------------------------------------- | --------------------------------------------- | ------- | ----- | ------------ |\n| **Telegram me when a model finishes downloading** | `notifications.model.download_ready.telegram` | off     | basic |              |"],[397,"| Setting                                           | Key                                  | Default | Level    | What it does                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          |\n| ------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------ | ------- | -------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Reach the engine computer when away from home** | `engines.stack.remote.allow_tailnet` | off     | advanced | Off, Home reaches the engine computer only from inside your home network. On, Home may also reach it through your private tailnet when you are away. Turn it on only if you have joined both computers to your tailnet yourself. Only an admin can change this. Shown only while the engine runs on another computer. |"],[467,"| Setting                                           | Key                | Default     | Level | What it does                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               |\n| ------------------------------------------------- | ------------------ | ----------- | ----- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| **Drugs, alcohol and betting with teen controls** | `topics.teen.risk` | informative | basic | How MaiPai answers teens' questions about drugs, alcohol, vaping, gambling and dangerous challenges. The standard answer explains the real risks and how to get help fast, and never gives tips for getting high, buying or betting. It applies to everyone on teen controls and is set by an admin. An admin cannot see what a teen asks. |"],[497,"| Setting                                          | Key                                  | Default | Level | What it does                                                                                                                       |\n| ------------------------------------------------ | ------------------------------------ | ------- | ----- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Send time-sensitive notifications to a robot** | `notifications.time_sensitive.robot` | off     | basic | Deliver time-sensitive notifications through a robot channel when one is configured. Private notification content is never spoken. |"],[404,"| Setting                                          | Key                            | Default | Level  | What it does                                               |\n| ------------------------------------------------ | ------------------------------ | ------- | ------ | ---------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Use the MaiPai Stack for search