ies` | informative | basic | How MaiPai answers teens' questions about puberty, sex, consent, relationships and identity. The standard answer is factual and respectful, and never sexual or romantic. It applies to everyone on teen controls and is set by an admin. An admin cannot see what a teen asks. |"],[507,"| Setting                                        | Key                        | Default | Level    | What it does                                                                                                                                                    |\n| ---------------------------------------------- | -------------------------- | ------- | -------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **This person's storage cap override (bytes)** | `storage.person.cap_bytes` | 0       | advanced | Overrides the household's default per-person cap for this one person. 0 means no override: this person follows the household default. Set by an owner or admin. |"],[458,"| Setting                                        | Key                        | Default | Level    | What it does                                                                     |\n| ---------------------------------------------- | -------------------------- | ------- | -------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Warn when free disk space drops below (GB)** | `storage.critical_free_gb` | 2       | advanced | A Repairs item is raised once free space on the hub's own disk drops below this. |"],[402,"| Setting                                      | Key                  | Default | Level    | What it does                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               |\n| -------------------------------------------- | -------------------- | ------- | -------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Help the chat remember to search the web** | `chat.search_assist` | shadow  | advanced | \"Off\" is the kill switch: nothing is scored. \"Shadow\" (the default) only counts, as a number, how often a web search looked needed, and changes no reply. \"Rescue\" is not active yet; for now it behaves like shadow. Children and teens are never scored. |"],[511,"| Setting                                     | Key                                             | Default | Level | What it does |\n| ------------------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------- | ------- | ----- | ------------ |\n| **Telegram me when a Stack engine updates** | `notifications.engines.update_applied.telegram` | off     | basic |              |"],[518,"| Setting                                     | Key                                            | Default | Level | What it does |\n| ------------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------------- | ------- | ----- | ------------ |\n| **Telegram me when a model download fails** | `notifications.model.download_failed.telegram` | off     | basic |              |"],[453,"| Setting                                     | Key                             | Default | Level | What it does                                                                                                                           |\n| ------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------- | ------- | ----- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Check whether the internet is reachable** | `status.internet_probe.enabled` | on      | basic | Once a minute, MaiPai looks up a neutral name and opens an empty connection to the chosen address. Turn this off to stop those checks. |"],[474,"| Setting                                     | Key                   | Default | Level | What it does                                                                            |\n| ------------------------------------------- | --------------------- | ------- | ----- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Adults allowed to view the robot camera** | `robot.live_view.who` | []      | basic | Admins can view. This list may name adults only; children and teens are never admitted. |"],[509,"| Setting                                    | Key                                             | Default | Level | What it does |\n| ------------------------------------------ | ----------------------------------------------- | ------- | ----- | ------------ |\n| **Telegram me when backups start failing** | `notifications.backups.target_failing.telegram` | off     | basic |              |"],[460,"| Setting                                    | Key                                | Default     | Level | What it does                                                                                             |\n| ------------------------------------------ | ---------------------------------- | ----------- | ----- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Default per-person storage cap (bytes)** | `storage.person.default_cap_bytes` | 21474836480 | basic | How many bytes each person may use for their own files, unless that person has their own override below. |"],[504,"| Setting                                    | Key                              | Default | Level  | What it does                                                                                                                                                               |\n| ------------------------------------------ | -------------------------------- | ------- | ------ | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Require PIN to unlock after inactivity** | `security.session_lock_required` | off     | expert | When on, this account locks behind its PIN or password after sitting idle. Content stays put; unlocking just re-enters the PIN. Set by an owner or admin, for any account. |"],[400,"| Setting                                    | Key                             | Default | Level    | What it does                                                                                                                                                                                                              |\n| ------------------------------------------ | ------------------------------- | ------- | -------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Engine computer secure connection port** | `engines.stack.remote.ssh_port` | 22      | advanced | The port Home uses to open its secure connection to the engine computer. Leave it at 22 unless that computer was set up differently. Only an admin can change this. Shown only while the engine runs on another computer. |"],[408,"| Setting                                    | Key              | Default | Level    | What it does                                                                                                                                                                  |\n| ------------------------------------------ | ---------------- | ------- | -------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Hugging Face token (for voice cloning)** | `voice.hf_token` | empty   | advanced | Needed to clone a voice from a recording. Accept the terms at huggingface.co/kyutai/pocket-tts, then create a read token at huggingface.co/settings/tokens and paste it here. |"],[528,"| Setting                                  | Key                     | Default | Level | What it does                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        |\n| ---------------------------------------- | ----------------------- | ------- | ----- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Santa Claus and other family stories** | `topics.family_stories` | keep    | basic | Whether MaiPai keeps stories like Santa Claus, the Tooth Fairy and the Easter Bunny for a child: it never says whether they are real, plays along, and points the child to the family. Turn it off if you would rather MaiPai answered plainly. Only a parent or admin can change a child's. It applies only while the person is on child controls. |"],[521,"| Setting                                 | Key                                  | Default | Level | What it does |\n| --------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------ | ------- | ----- | ------------ |\n| **Telegram me about new Repairs items** | `notifications.repairs.new.telegram` | off     | basic |              |"],[440,"| Setting                                 | Key                         | Default | Level    | What it does                                               |\n| --------------------------------------- | --------------------------- | ------- | -------- | ---------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Reference update speed limit (MB/s)** | `reference.update.max_mbps` | 20      | advanced | Not active yet. Planned; this setting has no effect today. |"],[475,"| Setting                                 | Key                    | Default | Level    | What it does                                                                                                                |\n| --------------------------------------- | ---------------------- | ------- | -------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Allow robot access over the tailnet** | `robot.offlan.tailnet` | off     | advanced | Off by default. Turn on only after the owner manually joins the device to the household tailnet; Home holds no tailnet key. |"],[419,"| Setting                                | Key                       | Default | Level    | What it does                                                                                                                                                                                                                             |\n| -------------------------------------- | ------------------------- | ------- | -------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Always block these sites for adult** | `search.hosts.adult.deny` | empty   | advanced | Sites that web search never shows to an adult, separated by commas, like example.com, on top of the household list. A site you list here also blocks its subpages. It always wins over the allowed lists. Only an admin can change this. |"],[415,"| Setting                                | Key                       | Default | Level    | What it does                                                                                                                                                                                                                            |\n| -------------------------------------- | ------------------------- | ------- | -------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Always block these sites for child** | `search.hosts.child.deny` | empty   | advanced | Sites that web search never shows to a child, separated by commas, like example.com, on top of the household list. A site you list here also blocks its subpages. It always wins over the allowed lists. Only an admin can change this. |"],[496,"| Setting                               | Key                                       | Default | Level | What it does                                                                                                                         |\n| ------------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------- | ------- | ----- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| **Don't notify me about shares from** | `notifications.file_shared.muted_senders` | []      | basic | Pick anyone in the household whose shared files you don't want a notification about. You'll still be notified about everyone else's. |"],[409,"| Setting                               | Key                       | Default                                  | Level    | What it does                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            |\n| ------------------------------------- | ------------------------- | ---------------------------------------- | -------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Blocked sites with child controls** | `search.blocklists.child` | [\"blp-gambling\", \"blp-scam\", \"blp-phishi | advanced | Which lists of blocked sites are checked when MaiPai searches the web for people using child controls. Adult sites are always blocked for child and teen controls and are not listed here. Home downloads each list once and keeps it up to date. Web search for child controls starts once every list checked here has been downloaded. Only an admin can change this. |"],[411,"| Setting                               | Key                       | Default | Level    | What it does                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 |\n| ------------------------------------- | ------------------------- | ------- | -------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Blocked sites with adult controls** | `search.blocklists.adult` | []      | advanced | Lists of blocked sites to check when MaiPai searches the web for adults. None are checked unless you pick them. Scam, phishing and malware lists are a good start for a household that wants that protection. Only an admin can change this. |"],[417,"| Setting                               | Key                      | Default | Level    | What it does                                                                                                                                                                                                                           |\n| ------------------------------------- | ------------------------ | ------- | -------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Always block these sites for teen** | `search.hosts.teen.deny` | empty   | advanced | Sites that web search never shows to a teen, separated by commas, like example.com, on top of the household list. A site you list here also blocks its subpages. It always wins over the allowed lists. Only an admin can change this. |"],[526,"| Setting                               | Key           | Default | Level | What it does                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        |\n| ------------------------------------- | ------------- | ------- | ----- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Drugs, alcohol, betting and dares** | `topics.risk` | default | basic | How MaiPai answers a child's questions about medicine, drugs, alcohol, vaping, betting and dangerous dares. The standard answer explains simply that these are unsafe or for adults. Only a parent or admin can change a child's. It applies only while the person is on child controls and never reaches the care, safety and fairness rules, which stay the same for every child. |"],[843,"| Setting                              | Default  | Effect                                                                                                                                                                     |\n| ------------------------------------ | -------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **How a teen's replies are checked** | Sentence | Sentence checks every sentence before a teen sees it. Arrival shows text as it is written and checks it as it comes, so part of a sentence can show before its check ends. |"],[506,"| Setting                              | Key                       | Default | Level    | What it does                                                                                   |\n| ------------------------------------ | ------------------------- | ------- | -------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **This person's storage quota (GB)** | `storage.person_quota_gb` | 0       | advanced | How much disk space this person's own uploads (cloned voices today) may use. 0 means no limit. |"],[410,"| Setting                              | Key                      | Default                                  | Level    | What it does                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 |\n| ------------------------------------ | ------------------------ | ---------------------------------------- | -------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Blocked sites with teen controls** | `search.blocklists.teen` | [\"blp-gambling\", \"blp-scam\", \"blp-phishi | advanced | Which lists of blocked sites are checked when MaiPai searches the web for people using teen controls. Adult sites are always blocked for child and teen controls and are not listed here. Web search for teen controls starts once every list checked here has been downloaded. Only an admin can change this. It does not show anyone what a teen searched for or which sites were blocked. |"],[547,"| Setting                              | Key                      | Default | Level | What it does                                                                       |\n| ------------------------------------ | ------------------------ | ------- | ----- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Robot may listen for a follow-up** | `person.robot.follow_up` | on      | basic | Adults and teens are on by default. Children are off unless a parent enables this. |"],[382,"| Setting                              | Key                    | Default  | Level    | What it does                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            |\n| ------------------------------------ | ---------------------- | -------- | -------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **How a teen's replies are checked** | `chat.teen_gate_grain` | sentence | advanced | \"Sentence\" checks every sentence before a teen sees it (the default). \"Arrival\" shows a teen's reply as it is written and checks it as it comes, so part of a sentence can show before its check finishes and the reply stops there if the check fails. Children and anything spoken always check every sentence first. |"],[527,"| Setting                              | Key               | Default | Level | What it does                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             |\n| ------------------------------------ | ----------------- | ------- | ----- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Violence, weapons and scary news** | `topics.violence` | default | basic | How MaiPai answers a child's questions about violence, weapons, war, scary news and scary stories. The standard answer says what happened without gore and that helpers keep people safe. Only a parent or admin can change a child's. It applies only while the person is on child controls and never reaches the care, safety and fairness rules, which stay the same for every child. |"],[122,"| Setting                            | Behavior                                                                                |\n| ---------------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Web search with child controls** | On: strictest SafeSearch, adult sites blocked, links hidden. Off: offline library only. |"],[845,"| Setting                            | Default                                                     |\n| ---------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Web search with child controls** | On: strictest SafeSearch, adult sites blocked, links hidden |"],[809,"| Setting                            | Default        |\n| ---------------------------------- | -------------- |\n| **News lists with adult controls** | Household news |"],[807,"| Setting                            | Default    |\n| ---------------------------------- | ---------- |\n| **News lists with child controls** | Kids' news |"],[461,"| Setting                            | Key                                     | Default | Level    | What it does                                                                                                                                                               |\n| ---------------------------------- | --------------------------------------- | ------- | -------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Conversation history retention** | `household.conversation_retention_days` | 90      | advanced | How long chat history is kept before it's deleted. A safety-flagged conversation involving a teen or child is always kept for at least 90 days regardless of this setting. |"],[505,"| Setting                            | Key                                     | Default | Level  | What it does                                                                             |\n| ---------------------------------- | --------------------------------------- | ------- | ------ | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Session lock timeout (minutes)** | `security.session_lock_timeout_minutes` | 5       | expert | How many minutes of inactivity before this account locks, when session lock is required. |"],[447,"| Setting                            | Key                     | Default | Level | What it does                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            |\n| ---------------------------------- | ----------------------- | ------- | ----- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Web search with child controls** | `search.web.child_mode` | on      | basic | When this is on, MaiPai can look things up on the web for people using child controls. Results go through SafeSearch at its strictest, adult sites are blocked, and links are hidden. When it is off, answers come only from the offline library. Only an admin can change this, and a child's searches show in that child's own chats. |"],[432,"| Setting                            | Key                | Default             | Level | What it does                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              |\n| ---------------------------------- | ------------------ | ------------------- | ----- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **News lists with adult controls** | `news.lists.adult` | [\"feeds-household\"] | basic | Which lists of news feeds appear on the news shelf for people using adult controls. A list that is not offered to this user type never appears here and is never shown to them. Every item is still checked by the age filter before anyone sees it. A list unchecked for every user type is switched off. Only an admin can change this. |"],[430,"| Setting                            | Key                | Default            | Level | What it does                                                                                                                                                                                                                        