ome asks first. If Home cannot do one, it shows the exact line to paste in Terminal at the Mac. They stop the Mac from sleeping, turn it back on after a power cut, stop big macOS upgrades by themselves (security updates stay on), and turn on SSH. One more lets the graphics chip use more memory. You only need that one for very big AI models later."],[1129,"Chat as usual."],[359,"Chat settings"],[1121,"Chat without saving anything, then let it all go."],[1401,"Check in on a child"],[1146,"Check that you are on the right page. Your own settings are under **Settings**."],[1183,"Check that your phone or computer is on your home Wi-Fi."],[42,"Check the chat id belongs to that person."],[43,"Check the event switch is on for that person."],[41,"Check the token has no spaces and the person messaged the bot first."],[1110,"Check them, then send the message."],[861,"Check what changed"],[287,"Check what leaves the house: Privacy audit."],[1007,"Children cannot create projects. The page is hidden while Incognito is on."],[1045,"Children rate with the thumbs only. To take back a rating, tap the lit thumb again."],[844,"Children, and anything spoken, always check every sentence first. An admin cannot see what a teen asks."],[1467,"Children's answers follow stricter settings. Only an owner or admin can change them. See Sensitive subjects."],[831,"Children's safe search is always strict. A teen's is never lower than moderate."],[1427,"Choose a level for each subject."],[215,"Choose hardware"],[231,"Choose hardware"],[1418,"Choose how MaiPai talks to a child about hard topics."],[100,"Choose where answers come from, connect SearXNG, and keep children and teens safe."],[782,"Choose which site lists apply to children and teens, add your own rules, and pick the news a child sees."],[750,"Choosing how reference library updates run, and capping their download speed, is planned, not available yet. The two settings exist but have no effect today."],[1090,"Click the box that says **Send a m